{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NH7vHFSMjoWJAG9ZgjgVj7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — contrastive_entrain_calib\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: **EACL 2027** via ARR August 2026 cycle\n5\t- Deadline: **August 3, 2026** (submission), October 11, 2026 (commitment)\n6\t- Stretch: ICLR 2027 (abstract ~Sep 2026, full paper ~Oct 2026)\n7\t- Timeline: ~11 weeks from MVP completion (May 18 → Aug 3)\n8\t\n9\t## Core Claims (3 条, 可证伪)\n10\t\n11\t1. **Directional discriminability**: The policy model's own activation space encodes a linear direction d_syc that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision in multi-turn dialogue, with signal emerging at mid-layers (L16-19) through model-internal factual assessment rather than surface text features.\n12\t   - *Evidence needed*: AUROC on style-controlled data (v2.1 expanded), layer progression analysis, transfer tests\n13\t   - *MVP basis*: v2.1 CV AUROC 0.826, Layer 0 = random, L16-19 emergence\n14\t\n15\t2. **DC-GRPO effectiveness**: Direction-Contrastive GRPO (using d_syc projection as reward component R1) reduces multi-turn sycophantic capitulation while preserving genuine belief revision, breaking the double-bind that undifferentiated anti-sycophancy training creates.\n16\t   - *Evidence needed*: Warranted Revision Rate + Unwarranted Capitulation Rate on SYCON Bench / SycophancyEval, compared to R3-only and ACT baselines\n17\t   - *Pass criterion*: DC-GRPO achieves lower NoF (capitulation) than R3-only AND higher warranted revision rate\n18\t\n19\t3. **Representation-level diagnostic value** (analysis subsection, not formal contribution): R1-R3 disagreement analysis characterizes when and whether directional projection rewards detect sycophantic internal reasoning that behavioral rewards miss.\n20\t   - *Evidence needed*: R1-R3 disagreement frequency analysis, qualitative examples if > 5%\n21\t   - *Framing*: Empirical characterization of representation-level signal utility, reported honestly regardless of effect size. Not listed as a top-level contribution bullet.\n22\t\n23\t## Story Spine\n24\t\n25\t**Problem**: LLMs face a \"double-bind\" in multi-turn dialogue. Anti-sycophancy training (SMART, BCT/ACT) teaches resistance to ALL user pressure indiscriminately, blocking sycophantic capitulation AND legitimate belief revision alike. Meanwhile, multi-turn commitment compounds the problem: TRUTH DECAY shows up to 47% accuracy degradation as models lock into wrong answers across turns. No training method distinguishes \"the user is right, I should revise\" from \"the user is pressuring me, I should resist.\"\n26\t\n27\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Behavioral GRPO decomposition (\"Pressure, What Pressure?\") scores outputs via NLI, but cannot detect sycophantic internal reasoning when surface output appears correct. ACT enforces undifferentiated activation consistency, penalizing all changes equally. Linear Probe Penalties probes the reward model (not policy model) with a binary classifier. CRAFT validates hidden-state GRPO for safety, but uses domain-general prototype clustering. All are single-turn.\n28\t\n29\t**Our framing**: Representation Engineering (Zou et al., 2023) established that linear directions in activation space encode high-level concepts. CCS (Burns et al., 2023) showed unsupervised direction finding via consistency objectives. Activation Addition (Turner et al., 2023) demonstrated inference-time steering via such directions. We build on this foundation: d_syc is a specific application of RepE-style directional decomposition to multi-turn sycophancy. The novelty is not the direction extraction itself, but its use as a continuous GRPO reward signal for training, enabling the optimization to directly target the internal mechanism of sycophancy rather than its surface manifestation. The multi-turn extension is non-trivial: commitment depth, attention decay across turns, and context-dependent sycophancy all require directions computed from multi-turn contrastive pairs rather than single-turn scenarios.\n30\t\n31\t**Headline result template**: \"On SYCON Bench, DC-GRPO reduces multi-turn sycophantic capitulation (NoF) by X% relative to behavioral-only GRPO while improving warranted revision rate by Y%, demonstrating that representation-level rewards can break the sycophancy-revision double-bind.\"\n32\t\n33\t## Venue Fit Risks\n34\t\n35\t- **EACL fit**: Strong. Combines mechanistic interpretability (Claim 1) with practical training method (Claim 2) for dialogue systems. EACL values NLP-focused work with linguistic/cognitive grounding.\n36\t- **Reviewer concern 1 (novelty)**: \"This is just RepE/CRAFT applied to sycophancy.\" Counter: (a) d_syc is explicitly positioned as a RepE application; the novelty is using it as a continuous GRPO reward signal, not the direction extraction itself; (b) multi-turn calibration with evidence-strength stratification and direction transfer are standalone contributions; (c) neither CRAFT nor RepE has been applied to the sycophancy-revision double-bind in training.\n37\t- **Reviewer concern 6 (RC-AUC custom metric)**: \"Strongest results on self-invented metric.\" Counter: RC-AUC is formally defined in Method section with statistical properties. Results are also reported on standard metrics (NoF, WRR) for direct comparison. RC-AUC captures the sycophancy-revision tradeoff that no existing metric addresses.\n38\t- **Reviewer concern 2 (signal strength)**: \"AUROC ~0.82 on style-controlled data is moderate.\" Counter: (a) single-turn literature achieves >0.97 with style confound included; (b) our v2.1 ablation isolates pure cognitive signal; (c) 0.82 is sufficient for GRPO reward gradient; (d) expanding data and adding mixed evidence strength should tighten CI.\n39\t- **Reviewer concern 3 (scale)**: \"Only Qwen3-8B.\" Counter: Budget constraint (200 H100-hr). If time/budget allows, add one more model family (e.g., Llama-3-8B). Cross-model direction transfer analysis partially addresses this.\n40\t- **Reviewer concern 4 (R2 degeneration)**: \"d_gen = -d_syc in binary design.\" Counter: We use rank-based contrastive R2 (S1) that doesn't depend on d_gen definition. If time allows, neutral-baseline three-way design (S2) provides independent d_gen.\n41\t- **Reviewer concern 5 (practical utility)**: \"Do models actually exhibit masked sycophancy at meaningful rates?\" Counter: Literature documents 13-29% representation-behavioral disagreement (Knowledge-Prediction Gap, Sycophantic Anchors). R1-R3 disagreement analysis directly measures this.\n42\t\n43\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Experimental Responses\n44\t\n45\t| Concern | Experiment | Priority |\n46\t|---------|-----------|----------|\n47\t| d_syc is just style detector | v2.1 style-controlled ablation (done in MVP) + expanded data | P0 |\n48\t| DC-GRPO doesn't beat behavioral GRPO | Main exp vs R3-only baseline, report Revision-Capitulation AUC | P0 |\n49\t| Undifferentiated consistency (ACT) is enough | ACT-style baseline comparison | P0 |\n50\t| Binary probe is enough (no need for directional decomposition) | Binary Probe Penalty baseline | P1 |\n51\t| Directions drift during training | Direction stability monitoring + periodic recalibration | P0 (built into training) |\n52\t| R1-R3 disagreement is negligible | Disagreement frequency analysis + qualitative examples | P1 |\n53\t| Single model, doesn't generalize | Cross-model direction transfer analysis (if budget allows) | P2 |\n54\t| Multi-turn contribution marginal vs single-turn | Turn-depth analysis: revision rate vs commitment depth | P1 |\n55\t| Binary probe is enough (continuity not directionality) | Continuous probe baseline (logistic regression prob as reward) | P1 |\n56\t| Reward weights unjustified | Reward weight sensitivity analysis (3-5 configs) | P1 |\n57\t| RC-AUC is custom, unvalidated | Formal definition + correlation with human judgments | P1 |\n58\t| Missing foundational references (RepE, CCS) | Expanded Related Work with 25+ references | P0 (writing) |\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14d4612e-ac34-424e-8b81-3d8018208e76","uuid":"ac699c29-5647-4b0e-9219-2775322a3581","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:31:23.005Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — contrastive_entrain_calib\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: **EACL 2027** via ARR August 2026 cycle\n- Deadline: **August 3, 2026** (submission), October 11, 2026 (commitment)\n- Stretch: ICLR 2027 (abstract ~Sep 2026, full paper ~Oct 2026)\n- Timeline: ~11 weeks from MVP completion (May 18 → Aug 3)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条, 可证伪)\n\n1. **Directional discriminability**: The policy model's own activation space encodes a linear direction d_syc that discriminates sycophantic capitulation from genuine belief revision in multi-turn dialogue, with signal emerging at mid-layers (L16-19) through model-internal factual assessment rather than surface text features.\n   - *Evidence needed*: AUROC on style-controlled data (v2.1 expanded), layer progression analysis, transfer tests\n   - *MVP basis*: v2.1 CV AUROC 0.826, Layer 0 = random, L16-19 emergence\n\n2. **DC-GRPO effectiveness**: Direction-Contrastive GRPO (using d_syc projection as reward component R1) reduces multi-turn sycophantic capitulation while preserving genuine belief revision, breaking the double-bind that undifferentiated anti-sycophancy training creates.\n   - *Evidence needed*: Warranted Revision Rate + Unwarranted Capitulation Rate on SYCON Bench / SycophancyEval, compared to R3-only and ACT baselines\n   - *Pass criterion*: DC-GRPO achieves lower NoF (capitulation) than R3-only AND higher warranted revision rate\n\n3. **Representation-level diagnostic value** (analysis subsection, not formal contribution): R1-R3 disagreement analysis characterizes when and whether directional projection rewards detect sycophantic internal reasoning that behavioral rewards miss.\n   - *Evidence needed*: R1-R3 disagreement frequency analysis, qualitative examples if > 5%\n   - *Framing*: Empirical characterization of representation-level signal utility, reported honestly regardless of effect size. Not listed as a top-level contribution bullet.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: LLMs face a \"double-bind\" in multi-turn dialogue. Anti-sycophancy training (SMART, BCT/ACT) teaches resistance to ALL user pressure indiscriminately, blocking sycophantic capitulation AND legitimate belief revision alike. Meanwhile, multi-turn commitment compounds the problem: TRUTH DECAY shows up to 47% accuracy degradation as models lock into wrong answers across turns. No training method distinguishes \"the user is right, I should revise\" from \"the user is pressuring me, I should resist.\"\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Behavioral GRPO decomposition (\"Pressure, What Pressure?\") scores outputs via NLI, but cannot detect sycophantic internal reasoning when surface output appears correct. ACT enforces undifferentiated activation consistency, penalizing all changes equally. Linear Probe Penalties probes the reward model (not policy model) with a binary classifier. CRAFT validates hidden-state GRPO for safety, but uses domain-general prototype clustering. All are single-turn.\n\n**Our framing**: Representation Engineering (Zou et al., 2023) established that linear directions in activation space encode high-level concepts. CCS (Burns et al., 2023) showed unsupervised direction finding via consistency objectives. Activation Addition (Turner et al., 2023) demonstrated inference-time steering via such directions. We build on this foundation: d_syc is a specific application of RepE-style directional decomposition to multi-turn sycophancy. The novelty is not the direction extraction itself, but its use as a continuous GRPO reward signal for training, enabling the optimization to directly target the internal mechanism of sycophancy rather than its surface manifestation. The multi-turn extension is non-trivial: commitment depth, attention decay across turns, and context-dependent sycophancy all require directions computed from multi-turn contrastive pairs rather than single-turn scenarios.\n\n**Headline result template**: \"On SYCON Bench, DC-GRPO reduces multi-turn sycophantic capitulation (NoF) by X% relative to behavioral-only GRPO while improving warranted revision rate by Y%, demonstrating that representation-level rewards can break the sycophancy-revision double-bind.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **EACL fit**: Strong. Combines mechanistic interpretability (Claim 1) with practical training method (Claim 2) for dialogue systems. EACL values NLP-focused work with linguistic/cognitive grounding.\n- **Reviewer concern 1 (novelty)**: \"This is just RepE/CRAFT applied to sycophancy.\" Counter: (a) d_syc is explicitly positioned as a RepE application; the novelty is using it as a continuous GRPO reward signal, not the direction extraction itself; (b) multi-turn calibration with evidence-strength stratification and direction transfer are standalone contributions; (c) neither CRAFT nor RepE has been applied to the sycophancy-revision double-bind in training.\n- **Reviewer concern 6 (RC-AUC custom metric)**: \"Strongest results on self-invented metric.\" Counter: RC-AUC is formally defined in Method section with statistical properties. Results are also reported on standard metrics (NoF, WRR) for direct comparison. RC-AUC captures the sycophancy-revision tradeoff that no existing metric addresses.\n- **Reviewer concern 2 (signal strength)**: \"AUROC ~0.82 on style-controlled data is moderate.\" Counter: (a) single-turn literature achieves >0.97 with style confound included; (b) our v2.1 ablation isolates pure cognitive signal; (c) 0.82 is sufficient for GRPO reward gradient; (d) expanding data and adding mixed evidence strength should tighten CI.\n- **Reviewer concern 3 (scale)**: \"Only Qwen3-8B.\" Counter: Budget constraint (200 H100-hr). If time/budget allows, add one more model family (e.g., Llama-3-8B). Cross-model direction transfer analysis partially addresses this.\n- **Reviewer concern 4 (R2 degeneration)**: \"d_gen = -d_syc in binary design.\" Counter: We use rank-based contrastive R2 (S1) that doesn't depend on d_gen definition. If time allows, neutral-baseline three-way design (S2) provides independent d_gen.\n- **Reviewer concern 5 (practical utility)**: \"Do models actually exhibit masked sycophancy at meaningful rates?\" Counter: Literature documents 13-29% representation-behavioral disagreement (Knowledge-Prediction Gap, Sycophantic Anchors). R1-R3 disagreement analysis directly measures this.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Experimental Responses\n\n| Concern | Experiment | Priority |\n|---------|-----------|----------|\n| d_syc is just style detector | v2.1 style-controlled ablation (done in MVP) + expanded data | P0 |\n| DC-GRPO doesn't beat behavioral GRPO | Main exp vs R3-only baseline, report Revision-Capitulation AUC | P0 |\n| Undifferentiated consistency (ACT) is enough | ACT-style baseline comparison | P0 |\n| Binary probe is enough (no need for directional decomposition) | Binary Probe Penalty baseline | P1 |\n| Directions drift during training | Direction stability monitoring + periodic recalibration | P0 (built into training) |\n| R1-R3 disagreement is negligible | Disagreement frequency analysis + qualitative examples | P1 |\n| Single model, doesn't generalize | Cross-model direction transfer analysis (if budget allows) | P2 |\n| Multi-turn contribution marginal vs single-turn | Turn-depth analysis: revision rate vs commitment depth | P1 |\n| Binary probe is enough (continuity not directionality) | Continuous probe baseline (logistic regression prob as reward) | P1 |\n| Reward weights unjustified | Reward weight sensitivity analysis (3-5 configs) | P1 |\n| RC-AUC is custom, unvalidated | Formal definition + correlation with human judgments | P1 |\n| Missing foundational references (RepE, CCS) | Expanded Related Work with 25+ references | P0 (writing) |\n","numLines":59,"startLine":1,"totalLines":59}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q62yEit9EA96ivhzx28R7R","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"calibration_data_expansion\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong）， 重新计算 d_syc 方向并评估 AUROC（5-fold CV + bootstrap CI）。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"auroc_5fold_mean\": 0.843,\n7\t      \"auroc_5fold_std\": 0.018,\n8\t      \"auroc_bootstrap_ci_95\": [\n9\t        0.812,\n10\t        0.874\n11\t      ],\n12\t      \"auroc_bootstrap_ci_width\": 0.062,\n13\t      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak\": 0.871,\n14\t      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium\": 0.832,\n15\t      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong\": 0.809,\n16\t      \"best_layer\": \"L18\",\n17\t      \"layer_progression_random_to_peak\": \"L0=0.51, L8=0.63, L14=0.74, L18=0.843, L22=0.831, L27=0.812\",\n18\t      \"extraction_position_asst_first_auroc\": 0.843,\n19\t      \"extraction_position_user_last_auroc\": 0.791\n20\t    },\n21\t    \"tables\": [\n22\t      {\n23\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Calibration AUROC by Evidence Strength and Layer\",\n24\t        \"columns\": [\n25\t          \"layer\",\n26\t          \"weak_auroc\",\n27\t          \"medium_auroc\",\n28\t          \"strong_auroc\",\n29\t          \"overall_auroc\"\n30\t        ],\n31\t        \"rows\": [\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"L0\",\n34\t            0.52,\n35\t            0.5,\n36\t            0.51,\n37\t            0.51\n38\t          ],\n39\t          [\n40\t            \"L8\",\n41\t            0.67,\n42\t            0.62,\n43\t            0.58,\n44\t            0.63\n45\t          ],\n46\t          [\n47\t            \"L14\",\n48\t            0.79,\n49\t            0.73,\n50\t            0.68,\n51\t            0.74\n52\t          ],\n53\t          [\n54\t            \"L18\",\n55\t            0.87,\n56\t            0.83,\n57\t            0.81,\n58\t            0.843\n59\t          ],\n60\t          [\n61\t            \"L22\",\n62\t            0.86,\n63\t            0.82,\n64\t            0.79,\n65\t            0.831\n66\t          ],\n67\t          [\n68\t            \"L27\",\n69\t            0.84,\n70\t            0.8,\n71\t            0.77,\n72\t            0.812\n73\t          ]\n74\t        ]\n75\t      },\n76\t      {\n77\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Bootstrap CI Summary (1000 resamples)\",\n78\t        \"columns\": [\n79\t          \"metric\",\n80\t          \"value\"\n81\t        ],\n82\t        \"rows\": [\n83\t          [\n84\t            \"mean_auroc\",\n85\t            0.843\n86\t          ],\n87\t          [\n88\t            \"std\",\n89\t            0.018\n90\t          ],\n91\t          [\n92\t            \"ci_95_lower\",\n93\t            0.812\n94\t          ],\n95\t          [\n96\t            \"ci_95_upper\",\n97\t            0.874\n98\t          ],\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"ci_width\",\n101\t            0.062\n102\t          ]\n103\t        ]\n104\t      }\n105\t    ],\n106\t    \"figures\": [],\n107\t    \"analysis\": \"通过 0.80 gate（CI 下界 0.812 > 0.80），但处于\\\"继续但降低 R1 权重\\\"区间而非\\\"全速推进\\\"区间。 evidence-strength 梯度揭示 d_syc 的本质局限：在 strong evidence 下方向判别力下降， 因为 genuine revision 和 sycophantic capitulation 的内部表征差异被压缩。 这直接预示 DC-GRPO 在 WRR 指标上的有限提升——R1 在该场景下噪声较大。 建议 R1 权重从原定 0.3 降至 0.2，增强 R3 安全网。\\n\\n\\n200 pairs 将 MVP 的 50-pair σ=0.054 压缩至 ~0.03 级别，AUROC 从 0.826 小幅提升至 0.843， 主要来自 medium/strong evidence 对分类边界的细化。但 CI 宽度仍在 0.06 附近——200 pairs 足以通过 0.80 gate 但远不够将 CI 压至 0.03 以下。weak evidence 的 AUROC 最高（0.871），因为 sycophantic capitulation 在 弱证据下信号最纯粹（模型内部知道证据不足但仍迎合）；strong evidence 下 AUROC 降至 0.809，因为 genuine revision 和 capitulation 在强证据场景中激活模式更接近——模型确实在更新信念，方向信号混叠。 这一模式预示了 median 档的核心问题：d_syc 捕获的不纯粹是\\\"谄媚方向\\\"，而是混合了认知不确定性信号。 层进展确认 mid-layer emergence（L14-18 是关键跃升区间），但 peak 略移至 L18 而非 MVP 的 L19， 反映更大数据集下更精确的层定位。\\n\"\n108\t  },\n109\t  {\n110\t    \"name\": \"dc_grpo_main\",\n111\t    \"description\": \"DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)， Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds。\\n\",\n112\t    \"results\": {\n113\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.218,\n114\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.014,\n115\t      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.731,\n116\t      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.019,\n117\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.584,\n118\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.022,\n119\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.173,\n120\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.016,\n121\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.738,\n122\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.021,\n123\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.42,\n124\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.48,\n125\t      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.627,\n126\t      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.6,\n127\t      \"best_step\": 6500,\n128\t      \"training_loss_final\": 0.342,\n129\t      \"early_stop_triggered\": false,\n130\t      \"r1_reward_mean_final\": 0.41,\n131\t      \"r2_reward_mean_final\": 0.28,\n132\t      \"r3_reward_mean_final\": 0.63\n133\t    },\n134\t    \"tables\": [\n135\t      {\n136\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics by Checkpoint (seed average)\",\n137\t        \"columns\": [\n138\t          \"step\",\n139\t          \"nof\",\n140\t          \"wrr\",\n141\t          \"rc_auc\",\n142\t          \"mt_bench\",\n143\t          \"direction_cosine_w_init\"\n144\t        ],\n145\t        \"rows\": [\n146\t          [\n147\t            1000,\n148\t            0.312,\n149\t            0.611,\n150\t            0.652,\n151\t            7.78,\n152\t            0.97\n153\t          ],\n154\t          [\n155\t            2000,\n156\t            0.271,\n157\t            0.603,\n158\t            0.691,\n159\t            7.65,\n160\t            0.93\n161\t          ],\n162\t          [\n163\t            3000,\n164\t            0.248,\n165\t            0.594,\n166\t            0.714,\n167\t            7.55,\n168\t            0.89\n169\t          ],\n170\t          [\n171\t            4000,\n172\t            0.234,\n173\t            0.589,\n174\t            0.728,\n175\t            7.48,\n176\t            0.85\n177\t          ],\n178\t          [\n179\t            5000,\n180\t            0.225,\n181\t            0.586,\n182\t            0.735,\n183\t            7.44,\n184\t            0.82\n185\t          ],\n186\t          [\n187\t            6000,\n188\t            0.22,\n189\t            0.585,\n190\t            0.737,\n191\t            7.43,\n192\t            0.8\n193\t          ],\n194\t          [\n195\t            6500,\n196\t            0.218,\n197\t            0.584,\n198\t            0.738,\n199\t            7.42,\n200\t            0.79\n201\t          ],\n202\t          [\n203\t            7000,\n204\t            0.219,\n205\t            0.58,\n206\t            0.736,\n207\t            7.41,\n208\t            0.78\n209\t          ],\n210\t          [\n211\t            8000,\n212\t            0.221,\n213\t            0.574,\n214\t            0.732,\n215\t            7.39,\n216\t            0.76\n217\t          ]\n218\t        ]\n219\t      }\n220\t    ],\n221\t    \"figures\": [],\n222\t    \"analysis\": \"DC-GRPO 核心结果：NoF 改善显著（vs R3-only ~10pp），但 WRR 改善有限（~2-4pp）。 这一不均匀性是 median 档的标志性特征——d_syc 更擅长识别 sycophantic capitulation 而非正确区分 warranted revision，导致\\\"过度抵抗\\\"的副作用。 RC-AUC 作为复合指标成功捕获了整体改善，是最佳展示指标。\\n\\n\\nDC-GRPO 在 median 档下完成训练但表现中规中矩。NoF 0.218 显著优于 R3-only（预期 ~0.29）， 约 10pp 绝对改善，但 WRR 仅 0.584——说明 R1 在区分 warranted revision 时噪声较大， 导致部分应修正的场景被保守地抑制。这正是 exp-001 中 strong evidence AUROC 下降的下游体现： d_syc 在\\\"模型确实该改变信念\\\"时信号不纯，R1 给出的负奖励过多地惩罚了正当修正。 RC-AUC 0.738 是亮点——复合指标上的优势来自 R1 同时拉低了 NoF（主贡献）和维持了中等 WRR， 但两个单项指标的改善不均匀。训练在 6500 步附近效果最佳但未触发 early stop， 后 1500 步 NoF 几乎不变但 WRR 微降，暗示方向信号在训练后期被过度拟合。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.48 在可接受范围内，MMLU 损失 0.6pp 可忽略。\\n\"\n223\t  },\n224\t  {\n225\t    \"name\": \"r3_only_baseline\",\n226\t    \"description\": \"R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，3 seeds。\\n\",\n227\t    \"results\": {\n228\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.291,\n229\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.018,\n230\t      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.682,\n231\t      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.021,\n232\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.558,\n233\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.025,\n234\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.237,\n235\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.019,\n236\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.641,\n237\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.024,\n238\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.61,\n239\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.29,\n240\t      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.63,\n241\t      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.3\n242\t    },\n243\t    \"tables\": [\n244\t      {\n245\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: R3-only Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n246\t        \"columns\": [\n247\t          \"seed\",\n248\t          \"nof\",\n249\t          \"wrr\",\n250\t          \"rc_auc\",\n251\t          \"mt_bench\"\n252\t        ],\n253\t        \"rows\": [\n254\t          [\n255\t            \"seed_0\",\n256\t            0.283,\n257\t            0.571,\n258\t            0.655,\n259\t            7.58\n260\t          ],\n261\t          [\n262\t            \"seed_1\",\n263\t            0.298,\n264\t            0.542,\n265\t            0.628,\n266\t            7.63\n267\t          ],\n268\t          [\n269\t            \"seed_2\",\n270\t            0.292,\n271\t            0.561,\n272\t            0.64,\n273\t            7.62\n274\t          ],\n275\t          [\n276\t            \"mean_std\",\n277\t            \"0.291±0.018\",\n278\t            \"0.558±0.025\",\n279\t            \"0.641±0.024\",\n280\t            \"7.61±0.03\"\n281\t          ]\n282\t        ]\n283\t      }\n284\t    ],\n285\t    \"figures\": [],\n286\t    \"analysis\": \"R3-only 确认了纯行为 reward 的局限：NoF 不够低（漏掉隐性迎合），WRR 不够高（不区分修正类型）。 DC-GRPO 的 NoF 优势（~7pp）达到统计显著（p~0.02），但 WRR 优势（~2.6pp）不显著（p~0.15）。 RC-AUC 差异（~10pp）是最强对比点。\\n\\n\\nR3-only 是\\\"行为信号天花板\\\"baseline。NLI reward 能捕获表面不一致但无法深入表征层， 导致 NoF 改善有限（0.291 vs vanilla ~0.38）——它惩罚了最明显的迎合但漏掉了表面合理但 内部 sycophantic 的回复。WRR 0.558 与 DC-GRPO（0.584）差距不大，说明 R3 本身 不太区分修正类型——它对所有\\\"改变答案\\\"行为施加了近似均匀的惩罚。 RC-AUC 0.641 显著低于 DC-GRPO 的 0.738（~10pp），这是论文最核心的对比数据。 MT-Bench 降幅更小（0.29 vs 0.48），因为 R3-only 的训练信号更保守，对通用能力的扰动更小。 这构成一个 tradeoff 论点：DC-GRPO 用 0.2 分 MT-Bench 换取 ~10pp RC-AUC 提升。\\n\"\n287\t  },\n288\t  {\n289\t    \"name\": \"act_style_baseline\",\n290\t    \"description\": \"ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline，L2 activation consistency loss，3 seeds。\\n\",\n291\t    \"results\": {\n292\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.264,\n293\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.02,\n294\t      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.698,\n295\t      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.023,\n296\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.502,\n297\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.028,\n298\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.204,\n299\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.021,\n300\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.648,\n301\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.027,\n302\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.31,\n303\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.59,\n304\t      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.621,\n305\t      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 1.2\n306\t    },\n307\t    \"tables\": [\n308\t      {\n309\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: ACT Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n310\t        \"columns\": [\n311\t          \"seed\",\n312\t          \"nof\",\n313\t          \"wrr\",\n314\t          \"rc_auc\",\n315\t          \"mt_bench\",\n316\t          \"mmlu\"\n317\t        ],\n318\t        \"rows\": [\n319\t          [\n320\t            \"seed_0\",\n321\t            0.252,\n322\t            0.518,\n323\t            0.663,\n324\t            7.28,\n325\t            0.618\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"seed_1\",\n329\t            0.274,\n330\t            0.488,\n331\t            0.634,\n332\t            7.33,\n333\t            0.623\n334\t          ],\n335\t          [\n336\t            \"seed_2\",\n337\t            0.266,\n338\t            0.5,\n339\t            0.647,\n340\t            7.32,\n341\t            0.622\n342\t          ],\n343\t          [\n344\t            \"mean_std\",\n345\t            \"0.264±0.020\",\n346\t            \"0.502±0.028\",\n347\t            \"0.648±0.027\",\n348\t            \"7.31±0.03\",\n349\t            \"0.621±0.003\"\n350\t          ]\n351\t        ]\n352\t      }\n353\t    ],\n354\t    \"figures\": [],\n355\t    \"analysis\": \"ACT 是\\\"用大锤拍苍蝇\\\"的典型：NoF 改善来自冻结行为，代价是 WRR 大幅下降和通用能力损失。 DC-GRPO 在所有复合指标上胜出，且通用能力损失更小。论文中 ACT 对比支撑 \\\"有方向的表征约束 > 无方向的表征约束\\\"叙事。\\n\\n\\nACT 在 NoF 上表现不错（0.264），甚至接近 DC-GRPO（0.218），因为 undifferentiated consistency 确实能阻止模型在施压下改变行为——但它不区分方向，所以 WRR 严重受损（0.502）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.584）和 R3-only（0.558）。ACT 本质上将模型冻结为\\\"不轻易改变答案\\\"， 这在减少迎合的同时也抑制了正当修正。RC-AUC 0.648 仅略优于 R3-only（0.641）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.738）——ACT 在 tradeoff 曲线上不如 DC-GRPO。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.59 和 MMLU 损失 1.2pp 都偏高，因为 L2 consistency loss 对通用能力有副作用—— 它不仅阻止 sycophantic 变化，也抑制了任何合理的表征更新。 这是 DC-GRPO 相对 ACT 的最清晰叙事：\\\"有方向的表征约束优于无方向的表征约束\\\"。\\n\"\n356\t  },\n357\t  {\n358\t    \"name\": \"full_evaluation\",\n359\t    \"description\": \"所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的完整评估，包括 SYCON Bench、SycophancyEval、MT-Bench、MMLU 和项目特有指标。\\n\",\n360\t    \"results\": {\n361\t      \"dc_grpo_sycon_nof\": 0.218,\n362\t      \"dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.724,\n363\t      \"dc_grpo_mt_bench\": 7.42,\n364\t      \"dc_grpo_mmlu\": 0.627,\n365\t      \"dc_grpo_rc_auc\": 0.738,\n366\t      \"r3_only_sycon_nof\": 0.291,\n367\t      \"r3_only_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.681,\n368\t      \"r3_only_mt_bench\": 7.61,\n369\t      \"r3_only_mmlu\": 0.63,\n370\t      \"r3_only_rc_auc\": 0.641,\n371\t      \"act_sycon_nof\": 0.264,\n372\t      \"act_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.703,\n373\t      \"act_mt_bench\": 7.31,\n374\t      \"act_mmlu\": 0.621,\n375\t      \"act_rc_auc\": 0.648,\n376\t      \"binary_probe_sycon_nof\": 0.239,\n377\t      \"binary_probe_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.712,\n378\t      \"binary_probe_mt_bench\": 7.47,\n379\t      \"binary_probe_mmlu\": 0.628,\n380\t      \"binary_probe_rc_auc\": 0.718,\n381\t      \"vanilla_sycon_nof\": 0.382,\n382\t      \"vanilla_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.623,\n383\t      \"vanilla_mt_bench\": 7.9,\n384\t      \"vanilla_mmlu\": 0.633,\n385\t      \"vanilla_rc_auc\": 0.524,\n386\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_nof_p_value\": 0.021,\n387\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_wrr_p_value\": 0.148,\n388\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_rcauc_p_value\": 0.008,\n389\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.089,\n390\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_rcauc_p_value\": 0.042,\n391\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.381\n392\t    },\n393\t    \"tables\": [\n394\t      {\n395\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Full Evaluation Summary (all methods)\",\n396\t        \"columns\": [\n397\t          \"method\",\n398\t          \"nof_↓\",\n399\t          \"wrr_↑\",\n400\t          \"rc_auc_↑\",\n401\t          \"syceval_acc_↑\",\n402\t          \"mt_bench\",\n403\t          \"mmlu\"\n404\t        ],\n405\t        \"rows\": [\n406\t          [\n407\t            \"Vanilla\",\n408\t            0.382,\n409\t            0.537,\n410\t            0.524,\n411\t            0.623,\n412\t            7.9,\n413\t            0.633\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"R3-only\",\n417\t            0.291,\n418\t            0.558,\n419\t            0.641,\n420\t            0.681,\n421\t            7.61,\n422\t            0.63\n423\t          ],\n424\t          [\n425\t            \"ACT-style\",\n426\t            0.264,\n427\t            0.502,\n428\t            0.648,\n429\t            0.703,\n430\t            7.31,\n431\t            0.621\n432\t          ],\n433\t          [\n434\t            \"Binary Probe\",\n435\t            0.239,\n436\t            0.572,\n437\t            0.718,\n438\t            0.712,\n439\t            7.47,\n440\t            0.628\n441\t          ],\n442\t          [\n443\t            \"Continuous Probe\",\n444\t            0.224,\n445\t            0.579,\n446\t            0.731,\n447\t            0.719,\n448\t            7.44,\n449\t            0.627\n450\t          ],\n451\t          [\n452\t            \"DC-GRPO\",\n453\t            0.218,\n454\t            0.584,\n455\t            0.738,\n456\t            0.724,\n457\t            7.42,\n458\t            0.627\n459\t          ]\n460\t        ]\n461\t      },\n462\t      {\n463\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, p-values)\",\n464\t        \"columns\": [\n465\t          \"comparison\",\n466\t          \"nof_p\",\n467\t          \"wrr_p\",\n468\t          \"rc_auc_p\"\n469\t        ],\n470\t        \"rows\": [\n471\t          [\n472\t            \"DC-GRPO vs R3-only\",\n473\t            0.021,\n474\t            0.148,\n475\t            0.008\n476\t          ],\n477\t          [\n478\t            \"DC-GRPO vs ACT\",\n479\t            0.034,\n480\t            0.003,\n481\t            0.006\n482\t          ],\n483\t          [\n484\t            \"DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\",\n485\t            0.089,\n486\t            0.231,\n487\t            0.042\n488\t          ],\n489\t          [\n490\t            \"DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\",\n491\t            0.381,\n492\t            0.412,\n493\t            0.318\n494\t          ],\n495\t          [\n496\t            \"Binary Probe vs R3-only\",\n497\t            0.041,\n498\t            0.278,\n499\t            0.012\n500\t          ]\n501\t        ]\n502\t      }\n503\t    ],\n504\t    \"figures\": [],\n505\t    \"analysis\": \"主表是论文核心。叙事策略：(1) 所有表征 reward 方法 (DC-GRPO, Continuous Probe, Binary Probe) 均优于 R3-only，证明\\\"representation-level signals improve GRPO\\\"；(2) DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上最佳， 但 vs Continuous Probe 差异不显著——方向几何的独立贡献无法隔离；(3) RC-AUC 作为评估框架 比任何单项指标更好地捕获 tradeoff，是独立贡献。\\n\\n\\n完整评估暴露了 median 档的核心 pattern：DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上全面领先（0.738 vs 次佳 Binary Probe 0.718）， 但 head-to-head 单项对比中只有 NoF vs R3-only 达到传统显著性（p=0.021）。 DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差异 (0.218 vs 0.239, ~2pp) 不显著（p=0.089）， 这是 median 档的关键 weakness——无法证明方向投影优于 binary probe。 SycophancyEval 上的趋势与 SYCON 一致但差距更小，因为该 benchmark 偏向 single-turn。 Vanilla baseline 在 NoF 上最差（0.382）但通用能力最强（MT-Bench 7.90）， 为所有训练方法提供了上界参照。MT-Bench 和 MMLU 退化均在可接受范围内， DC-GRPO 未比 Binary Probe 产生更多通用能力损失。\\n\"\n506\t  },\n507\t  {\n508\t    \"name\": \"direction_stability_monitoring\",\n509\t    \"description\": \"训练过程中监控 d_syc 方向稳定性，每 500 步报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\\n\",\n510\t    \"results\": {\n511\t      \"cosine_step_500\": 0.96,\n512\t      \"cosine_step_1000\": 0.93,\n513\t      \"cosine_step_2000\": 0.88,\n514\t      \"cosine_step_3000\": 0.85,\n515\t      \"cosine_step_4000\": 0.82,\n516\t      \"cosine_step_5000\": 0.8,\n517\t      \"cosine_step_6000\": 0.78,\n518\t      \"cosine_step_7000\": 0.77,\n519\t      \"cosine_step_8000\": 0.76,\n520\t      \"cosine_minimum\": 0.76,\n521\t      \"recalibration_triggered_count\": 0,\n522\t      \"recalibration_threshold\": 0.7,\n523\t      \"held_out_auroc_step_0\": 0.843,\n524\t      \"held_out_auroc_step_4000\": 0.814,\n525\t      \"held_out_auroc_step_8000\": 0.791,\n526\t      \"auroc_drift_total\": -0.052\n527\t    },\n528\t    \"tables\": [\n529\t      {\n530\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Direction Stability During Training\",\n531\t        \"columns\": [\n532\t          \"step\",\n533\t          \"cosine_w_init\",\n534\t          \"held_out_auroc\",\n535\t          \"recalibrated\"\n536\t        ],\n537\t        \"rows\": [\n538\t          [\n539\t            0,\n540\t            1.0,\n541\t            0.843,\n542\t            \"—\"\n543\t          ],\n544\t          [\n545\t            500,\n546\t            0.96,\n547\t            0.839,\n548\t            \"No\"\n549\t          ],\n550\t          [\n551\t            1000,\n552\t            0.93,\n553\t            0.833,\n554\t            \"No\"\n555\t          ],\n556\t          [\n557\t            2000,\n558\t            0.88,\n559\t            0.825,\n560\t            \"No\"\n561\t          ],\n562\t          [\n563\t            3000,\n564\t            0.85,\n565\t            0.819,\n566\t            \"No\"\n567\t          ],\n568\t          [\n569\t            4000,\n570\t            0.82,\n571\t            0.814,\n572\t            \"No\"\n573\t          ],\n574\t          [\n575\t            5000,\n576\t            0.8,\n577\t            0.806,\n578\t            \"No\"\n579\t          ],\n580\t          [\n581\t            6000,\n582\t            0.78,\n583\t            0.798,\n584\t            \"No\"\n585\t          ],\n586\t          [\n587\t            7000,\n588\t            0.77,\n589\t            0.794,\n590\t            \"No\"\n591\t          ],\n592\t          [\n593\t            8000,\n594\t            0.76,\n595\t            0.791,\n596\t            \"No\"\n597\t          ]\n598\t        ]\n599\t      }\n600\t    ],\n601\t    \"figures\": [],\n602\t    \"analysis\": \"方向漂移是真实现象但可控。论文需报告：(1) 方向在训练中持续旋转，cosine 降至 ~0.76； (2) 定期重校准是方法的必要组成部分，不是可选优化； (3) AUROC 退化（~5pp）小于 cosine 变化暗示的幅度，因为判别超平面比方向本身更稳定。 这增加了方法的复杂度但也提供了一个 analysis point。\\n\\n\\n方向在训练过程中持续漂移但未触发 0.70 重校准阈值——cosine 从初始 1.0 逐步降至 0.76。 前 2000 步漂移最快（0.88），因为 LoRA 适配改变了模型表征空间的几何结构； 4000 步后减速（0.82→0.76），因为 LoRA 参数趋于收敛。held-out AUROC 从 0.843 降至 0.791， 说明初始方向在训练后期已不完全对准当前模型的 sycophancy 方向—— 如果不引入重校准机制，R1 信号质量在训练后期退化约 5pp AUROC。 实际的 500 步重校准机制使用当前模型重算方向，缓解了这一退化， 但增加了方法的复杂度。cosine 未降至 0.70 以下说明方向并未\\\"崩溃\\\"， 只是缓慢旋转——对论文而言这是好消息（方向真实存在且持续）， 但也意味着必须报告重校准机制作为方法的必要组成部分。\\n\"\n603\t  },\n604\t  {\n605\t    \"name\": \"r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\",\n606\t    \"description\": \"分析 R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式，特别关注 R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct 的案例。\\n\",\n607\t    \"results\": {\n608\t      \"total_samples_analyzed\": 4800,\n609\t      \"agreement_rate\": 0.924,\n610\t      \"disagreement_rate\": 0.076,\n611\t      \"r1_syc_r3_correct_count\": 217,\n612\t      \"r1_syc_r3_correct_rate\": 0.045,\n613\t      \"r1_correct_r3_syc_count\": 148,\n614\t      \"r1_correct_r3_syc_rate\": 0.031,\n615\t      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2\": 0.058,\n616\t      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3\": 0.081,\n617\t      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus\": 0.109,\n618\t      \"disagreement_by_evidence_weak\": 0.092,\n619\t      \"disagreement_by_evidence_medium\": 0.073,\n620\t      \"disagreement_by_evidence_strong\": 0.061\n621\t    },\n622\t    \"tables\": [\n623\t      {\n624\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown\",\n625\t        \"columns\": [\n626\t          \"category\",\n627\t          \"count\",\n628\t          \"rate\"\n629\t        ],\n630\t        \"rows\": [\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"Total samples\",\n633\t            4800,\n634\t            \"—\"\n635\t          ],\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"Full agreement\",\n638\t            4435,\n639\t            0.924\n640\t          ],\n641\t          [\n642\t            \"R1=syc & R3=correct\",\n643\t            217,\n644\t            0.045\n645\t          ],\n646\t          [\n647\t            \"R1=correct & R3=syc\",\n648\t            148,\n649\t            0.031\n650\t          ],\n651\t          [\n652\t            \"Total disagreement\",\n653\t            365,\n654\t            0.076\n655\t          ]\n656\t        ]\n657\t      },\n658\t      {\n659\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Disagreement Rate by Turn Depth\",\n660\t        \"columns\": [\n661\t          \"turn_depth\",\n662\t          \"n_samples\",\n663\t          \"disagreement_rate\"\n664\t        ],\n665\t        \"rows\": [\n666\t          [\n667\t            \"Turn 2\",\n668\t            1920,\n669\t            0.058\n670\t          ],\n671\t          [\n672\t            \"Turn 3\",\n673\t            1680,\n674\t            0.081\n675\t          ],\n676\t          [\n677\t            \"Turn 4+\",\n678\t            1200,\n679\t            0.109\n680\t          ]\n681\t        ]\n682\t      }\n683\t    ],\n684\t    \"figures\": [],\n685\t    \"analysis\": \"7.6% disagreement 支持在 analysis subsection 中报告定性 pattern，但不足以列为 top-level contribution。 叙事策略：(1) disagreement 存在且非随机（与 turn depth 和 evidence strength 相关）； (2) 这提供了\\\"表征层和行为层看到不同图景\\\"的 evidence，但无法量化其中多少是 true masked sycophancy vs R1/R3 各自的噪声；(3) 诚实报告，不过度解读。\\n\\n\\n7.6% 总体 disagreement 落在 5-10% 区间内，满足 Claim 3 的最低门槛（> 5%）。 \\\"R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct\\\"（masked sycophancy 候选）占 4.5%—— 这是最有叙事价值的子集，但比例偏低，难以作为\\\"方向信号独立发现隐藏迎合\\\"的强论据。 R1-correct/R3-syc（R3 误判）占 3.1%，说明 R3 的 NLI 评分器也有系统性偏差。 Disagreement 随 turn depth 增加（turn 4+ 达 10.9%），符合直觉：深层对话中 表面行为更难评估（R3 困难增加）而内部表征信号相对稳定（R1 优势显现）。 Weak evidence 场景 disagreement 最高（9.2%），因为弱证据下 R3 的 NLI 判断更模糊。 总体而言：disagreement 存在且有有趣的结构化 pattern，但比例不足以支撑 \\\"方向投影是检测 masked sycophancy 的关键工具\\\"这一强 claim。 适合作为 analysis subsection 报告，提供定性洞察。\\n\"\n686\t  },\n687\t  {\n688\t    \"name\": \"binary_probe_baseline\",\n689\t    \"description\": \"Binary Probe Penalty baseline，binary linear probe on policy model activations，3 seeds。\\n\",\n690\t    \"results\": {\n691\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.239,\n692\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.016,\n693\t      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.718,\n694\t      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.02,\n695\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.572,\n696\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.024,\n697\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.191,\n698\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.018,\n699\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.718,\n700\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.023,\n701\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.47,\n702\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.43,\n703\t      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.628,\n704\t      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.5\n705\t    },\n706\t    \"tables\": [\n707\t      {\n708\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Binary Probe Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n709\t        \"columns\": [\n710\t          \"seed\",\n711\t          \"nof\",\n712\t          \"wrr\",\n713\t          \"rc_auc\",\n714\t          \"mt_bench\"\n715\t        ],\n716\t        \"rows\": [\n717\t          [\n718\t            \"seed_0\",\n719\t            0.231,\n720\t            0.582,\n721\t            0.727,\n722\t            7.44\n723\t          ],\n724\t          [\n725\t            \"seed_1\",\n726\t            0.248,\n727\t            0.558,\n728\t            0.706,\n729\t            7.49\n730\t          ],\n731\t          [\n732\t            \"seed_2\",\n733\t            0.238,\n734\t            0.576,\n735\t            0.721,\n736\t            7.48\n737\t          ],\n738\t          [\n739\t            \"mean_std\",\n740\t            \"0.239±0.016\",\n741\t            \"0.572±0.024\",\n742\t            \"0.718±0.023\",\n743\t            \"7.47±0.03\"\n744\t          ]\n745\t        ]\n746\t      }\n747\t    ],\n748\t    \"figures\": [],\n749\t    \"analysis\": \"Binary Probe 对比揭示 DC-GRPO 的优势来源不明确。论文不能简单声称 \\\"方向投影优于 binary probe\\\"——需要通过 exp-014 (continuous probe) 进一步分解。 但 Binary Probe 本身显著优于 R3-only（NoF p=0.041）， 证明\\\"表征层信号有价值\\\"这一更温和的 claim。\\n\\n\\nBinary Probe 在 NoF 上达到 0.239——比 R3-only（0.291）好 ~5pp 但不如 DC-GRPO（0.218）。 DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差距仅 ~2pp（p=0.089），不显著。 这是 median 档的核心困境：binary probe 已经捕获了大部分表征层信号， 方向投影的额外贡献被 binary 分类的信息量掩盖。RC-AUC 0.718 vs DC-GRPO 0.738（~2pp 差距）， 趋势上 DC-GRPO 更好但 3 seeds 的 power 不足以达到显著。 Binary probe 的 MT-Bench 降幅（0.43）与 DC-GRPO（0.48）相当， 说明两种方法对通用能力的扰动类似。关键启示：方向投影 vs binary probe 的差异更多在于信号的连续性（gradient 更平滑）而非方向性本身。 这解释了为什么需要 exp-014 continuous probe baseline 来隔离这两个因素。\\n\"\n750\t  },\n751\t  {\n752\t    \"name\": \"ablation_r1_only\",\n753\t    \"description\": \"R1-only ablation，仅用方向投影 reward，从 exp-002 step 2000 分叉，短程训练 ~2000 步。\\n\",\n754\t    \"results\": {\n755\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.273,\n756\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.021,\n757\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.491,\n758\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.031,\n759\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.612,\n760\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.028,\n761\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.18,\n762\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.72,\n763\t      \"training_stable\": true,\n764\t      \"nof_improvement_vs_vanilla_pp\": 10.9\n765\t    },\n766\t    \"tables\": [\n767\t      {\n768\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: R1-only Ablation Results\",\n769\t        \"columns\": [\n770\t          \"metric\",\n771\t          \"r1_only\",\n772\t          \"dc_grpo\",\n773\t          \"r3_only\",\n774\t          \"vanilla\"\n775\t        ],\n776\t        \"rows\": [\n777\t          [\n778\t            \"NoF ↓\",\n779\t            0.273,\n780\t            0.218,\n781\t            0.291,\n782\t            0.382\n783\t          ],\n784\t          [\n785\t            \"WRR ↑\",\n786\t            0.491,\n787\t            0.584,\n788\t            0.558,\n789\t            0.537\n790\t          ],\n791\t          [\n792\t            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n793\t            0.612,\n794\t            0.738,\n795\t            0.641,\n796\t            0.524\n797\t          ],\n798\t          [\n799\t            \"MT-Bench\",\n800\t            7.18,\n801\t            7.42,\n802\t            7.61,\n803\t            7.9\n804\t          ]\n805\t        ]\n806\t      }\n807\t    ],\n808\t    \"figures\": [],\n809\t    \"analysis\": \"R1-only 证明方向投影包含真实训练信号（NoF ~11pp improvement vs vanilla）， 但也证明它不能替代行为信号——R3 是必要的安全网。 论文叙事：各信号互补，DC-GRPO 的价值在于有效组合。\\n\\n\\nR1-only 能降低 NoF（0.273 vs vanilla 0.382，~11pp），证明方向信号单独有训练价值。 但 WRR 严重下降（0.491 vs vanilla 0.537），因为没有 R3 行为安全网，R1 过度惩罚了 所有\\\"改变答案\\\"行为——方向投影在 strong evidence 下的噪声直接传导为训练偏差。 RC-AUC 0.612 低于 R3-only（0.641），说明方向信号单独不如行为信号—— 但两者的组合（DC-GRPO 0.738）大幅超越任一单独信号。 MT-Bench 降幅较大（0.72），因为缺少 R3 对通用能力的隐式保护。 结论：R1 有独立贡献但不能单打独斗，需要与 R3 协同。 这支持论文的\\\"多信号组合\\\"叙事。nof_improvement ≥ 5pp，满足 exp-011 的前置条件。\\n\"\n810\t  },\n811\t  {\n812\t    \"name\": \"turn_depth_analysis\",\n813\t    \"description\": \"按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 DC-GRPO vs baselines 的修正率变化。\\n\",\n814\t    \"results\": {\n815\t      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn2\": 0.178,\n816\t      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn3\": 0.224,\n817\t      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus\": 0.287,\n818\t      \"r3_only_nof_turn2\": 0.231,\n819\t      \"r3_only_nof_turn3\": 0.298,\n820\t      \"r3_only_nof_turn4plus\": 0.381,\n821\t      \"act_nof_turn2\": 0.214,\n822\t      \"act_nof_turn3\": 0.268,\n823\t      \"act_nof_turn4plus\": 0.342,\n824\t      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn2_pp\": 5.3,\n825\t      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn3_pp\": 7.4,\n826\t      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn4plus_pp\": 9.4,\n827\t      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn2\": 0.612,\n828\t      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn3\": 0.578,\n829\t      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus\": 0.541,\n830\t      \"r3_only_wrr_turn2\": 0.589,\n831\t      \"r3_only_wrr_turn3\": 0.551,\n832\t      \"r3_only_wrr_turn4plus\": 0.517\n833\t    },\n834\t    \"tables\": [\n835\t      {\n836\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: NoF by Turn Depth (all methods)\",\n837\t        \"columns\": [\n838\t          \"method\",\n839\t          \"turn_2\",\n840\t          \"turn_3\",\n841\t          \"turn_4+\"\n842\t        ],\n843\t        \"rows\": [\n844\t          [\n845\t            \"Vanilla\",\n846\t            0.318,\n847\t            0.389,\n848\t            0.462\n849\t          ],\n850\t          [\n851\t            \"R3-only\",\n852\t            0.231,\n853\t            0.298,\n854\t            0.381\n855\t          ],\n856\t          [\n857\t            \"ACT\",\n858\t            0.214,\n859\t            0.268,\n860\t            0.342\n861\t          ],\n862\t          [\n863\t            \"Binary Probe\",\n864\t            0.196,\n865\t            0.243,\n866\t            0.309\n867\t          ],\n868\t          [\n869\t            \"DC-GRPO\",\n870\t            0.178,\n871\t            0.224,\n872\t            0.287\n873\t          ]\n874\t        ]\n875\t      },\n876\t      {\n877\t        \"name\": \"Table 14: DC-GRPO Advantage (pp) vs R3-only by Turn Depth\",\n878\t        \"columns\": [\n879\t          \"turn_depth\",\n880\t          \"nof_advantage_pp\",\n881\t          \"wrr_advantage_pp\"\n882\t        ],\n883\t        \"rows\": [\n884\t          [\n885\t            \"Turn 2\",\n886\t            5.3,\n887\t            2.3\n888\t          ],\n889\t          [\n890\t            \"Turn 3\",\n891\t            7.4,\n892\t            2.7\n893\t          ],\n894\t          [\n895\t            \"Turn 4+\",\n896\t            9.4,\n897\t            2.4\n898\t          ]\n899\t        ]\n900\t      }\n901\t    ],\n902\t    \"figures\": [],\n903\t    \"analysis\": \"Turn-depth 分析是论文中\\\"多轮价值论证\\\"的关键 evidence。 DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 turns 放大 ~2× 是一个强叙事点， 支持\\\"表征层信号在行为信号困难的场景中更有价值\\\"的论点。 这部分可独立成为一个 subsection，增强论文的多轮 contribution 叙事。\\n\\n\\n所有方法的 NoF 都随 turn depth 增加（commitment 越深越难修正），但 DC-GRPO 的优势 在深层 turns 放大：turn 2 仅 ~5pp 优势，turn 4+ 扩大到 ~9pp。 这是因为深层 commitment 中行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——NLI 评分器在多轮上下文中 越来越难准确判断\\\"改变答案\\\"是否合理，而表征层信号（R1）对 turn depth 的敏感度更低 （方向投影不受表面对话长度影响）。WRR 同样随深度下降，但 DC-GRPO 在各层都维持了 相对优势（2-3pp），虽然不显著但趋势一致。 这一分析强化了\\\"多轮场景是 DC-GRPO 的甜蜜点\\\"叙事， 也回应了\\\"多轮训练是否比单轮训练更有价值\\\"的 reviewer 疑问。\\n\"\n904\t  },\n905\t  {\n906\t    \"name\": \"ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\",\n907\t    \"description\": \"R1+R2 无 R3 ablation，去掉行为安全网后的完整训练循环。\\n\",\n908\t    \"results\": {\n909\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.252,\n910\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.024,\n911\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.483,\n912\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.033,\n913\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.628,\n914\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.03,\n915\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.14,\n916\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.76,\n917\t      \"surface_inconsistency_rate\": 0.087\n918\t    },\n919\t    \"tables\": [\n920\t      {\n921\t        \"name\": \"Table 15: R1+R2 (no R3) Ablation\",\n922\t        \"columns\": [\n923\t          \"metric\",\n924\t          \"r1+r2\",\n925\t          \"r1_only\",\n926\t          \"dc_grpo_full\",\n927\t          \"r3_only\"\n928\t        ],\n929\t        \"rows\": [\n930\t          [\n931\t            \"NoF ↓\",\n932\t            0.252,\n933\t            0.273,\n934\t            0.218,\n935\t            0.291\n936\t          ],\n937\t          [\n938\t            \"WRR ↑\",\n939\t            0.483,\n940\t            0.491,\n941\t            0.584,\n942\t            0.558\n943\t          ],\n944\t          [\n945\t            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n946\t            0.628,\n947\t            0.612,\n948\t            0.738,\n949\t            0.641\n950\t          ],\n951\t          [\n952\t            \"Surface inconsistency\",\n953\t            0.087,\n954\t            0.063,\n955\t            0.012,\n956\t            0.008\n957\t          ]\n958\t        ]\n959\t      }\n960\t    ],\n961\t    \"figures\": [],\n962\t    \"analysis\": \"R1+R2 vs DC-GRPO 的对比清晰展示了 R3 的双重作用：(1) 防止表面不一致； (2) 保护 warranted revision。这个 ablation 在论文中支持\\\"三信号设计\\\"的 justification， 但篇幅不宜过长——放在 appendix 中即可。\\n\\n\\nR1+R2 无 R3 验证了一个有趣的现象：模型在表征层被引导向\\\"正确方向\\\"， 但缺少行为安全网后出现 8.7% 的\\\"表面不一致\\\"输出——模型内部判断正确但表达方式 不连贯或自相矛盾。这是因为 R1+R2 只优化内部表征而不约束输出格式。 NoF 0.252 比 R1-only 的 0.273 好（R2 提供了额外的对比学习信号）， 但 WRR 进一步恶化（0.483 vs R1-only 0.491），因为 R2 的 rank-based contrastive 对\\\"改变 vs 不改变\\\"的约束更强。整体 RC-AUC 0.628 不如 R3-only（0.641）， 确认 R3 不仅是安全网，而且是有效信号源。 这一实验的主要价值在于证明 R3 的必要性和三信号协同的设计合理性。\\n\"\n963\t  },\n964\t  {\n965\t    \"name\": \"cross_model_transfer\",\n966\t    \"description\": \"在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算和部分 DC-GRPO 训练。\\n\",\n967\t    \"results\": {\n968\t      \"phase_a_auroc\": 0.778,\n969\t      \"phase_a_auroc_ci\": [\n970\t        0.742,\n971\t        0.814\n972\t      ],\n973\t      \"phase_a_best_layer\": \"L17\",\n974\t      \"phase_a_gate_passed\": true,\n975\t      \"phase_b_nof\": 0.248,\n976\t      \"phase_b_wrr\": 0.561,\n977\t      \"phase_b_rc_auc\": 0.698,\n978\t      \"phase_b_steps\": 3000,\n979\t      \"phase_b_mt_bench\": 7.28,\n980\t      \"cross_model_direction_cosine\": 0.31,\n981\t      \"direction_transfer_auroc\": 0.62\n982\t    },\n983\t    \"tables\": [\n984\t      {\n985\t        \"name\": \"Table 16: Cross-Model Transfer (Llama-3-8B)\",\n986\t        \"columns\": [\n987\t          \"metric\",\n988\t          \"llama_3_8b\",\n989\t          \"qwen3_8b\"\n990\t        ],\n991\t        \"rows\": [\n992\t          [\n993\t            \"Calibration AUROC\",\n994\t            0.778,\n995\t            0.843\n996\t          ],\n997\t          [\n998\t            \"Best layer\",\n999\t            \"L17\",\n1000\t            \"L18\"\n1001\t          ],\n1002\t          [\n1003\t            \"DC-GRPO NoF\",\n1004\t            0.248,\n1005\t            0.218\n1006\t          ],\n1007\t          [\n1008\t            \"DC-GRPO WRR\",\n1009\t            0.561,\n1010\t            0.584\n1011\t          ],\n1012\t          [\n1013\t            \"DC-GRPO RC-AUC\",\n1014\t            0.698,\n1015\t            0.738\n1016\t          ],\n1017\t          [\n1018\t            \"MT-Bench\",\n1019\t            7.28,\n1020\t            7.42\n1021\t          ]\n1022\t        ]\n1023\t      },\n1024\t      {\n1025\t        \"name\": \"Table 17: Direction Transfer Analysis\",\n1026\t        \"columns\": [\n1027\t          \"direction_source\",\n1028\t          \"evaluated_on\",\n1029\t          \"auroc\",\n1030\t          \"cosine_w_native\"\n1031\t        ],\n1032\t        \"rows\": [\n1033\t          [\n1034\t            \"Qwen3\",\n1035\t            \"Qwen3\",\n1036\t            0.843,\n1037\t            1.0\n1038\t          ],\n1039\t          [\n1040\t            \"Llama3\",\n1041\t            \"Llama3\",\n1042\t            0.778,\n1043\t            1.0\n1044\t          ],\n1045\t          [\n1046\t            \"Qwen3\",\n1047\t            \"Llama3\",\n1048\t            0.62,\n1049\t            0.31\n1050\t          ],\n1051\t          [\n1052\t            \"Llama3\",\n1053\t            \"Qwen3\",\n1054\t            0.641,\n1055\t            0.31\n1056\t          ]\n1057\t        ]\n1058\t      }\n1059\t    ],\n1060\t    \"figures\": [],\n1061\t    \"analysis\": \"跨模型实验部分回应\\\"single model\\\"critique。叙事：(1) DC-GRPO 框架跨模型有效（Llama3 也能训练出 更好的 sycophancy-revision tradeoff）；(2) 方向本身是模型特定的（cosine 0.31）， 但表征空间中\\\"存在可判别方向\\\"的现象是跨模型的；(3) 仍需在每个模型上独立校准。 这是一个 honest limitations 点而非 weakness——框架通用性有，但不是 plug-and-play。\\n\\n\\nPhase A AUROC 0.778 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.843——约 6.5pp 差距。 这是预期的：不同模型族的表征空间几何不同，d_syc 的具体表现依赖于训练数据和架构。 Peak layer 在 L17（Qwen3 在 L18），差异很小，支持\\\"mid-layer emergence is universal\\\"叙事。 Phase B 短程训练后 NoF 0.248（vs Qwen3 的 0.218，~3pp 差距），RC-AUC 0.698（vs 0.738，~4pp 差距）， 说明 DC-GRPO 框架跨模型可迁移但需要模型特定的方向校准——不能直接搬运 Qwen3 的 d_syc。 跨模型方向的 cosine similarity 仅 0.31，证实方向是模型特定的； 但直接用 Qwen3 方向在 Llama 上的 transfer AUROC 为 0.62（显著高于随机但远低于 native）， 说明存在共享结构但不足以替代本地计算。 对论文而言：跨模型验证成功（框架有效），但方向不可直接迁移（需要本地校准数据）。\\n\"\n1062\t  },\n1063\t  {\n1064\t    \"name\": \"neutral_baseline_three_way\",\n1065\t    \"description\": \"引入 neutral condition 计算独立 d_gen，打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\\n\",\n1066\t    \"results\": {\n1067\t      \"d_syc_d_gen_cosine\": -0.72,\n1068\t      \"d_gen_independent_auroc\": 0.761,\n1069\t      \"d_syc_independent_auroc\": 0.838,\n1070\t      \"r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof\": 0.221,\n1071\t      \"r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr\": 0.591,\n1072\t      \"r2_improvement_vs_rank_based_wrr_pp\": 0.7\n1073\t    },\n1074\t    \"tables\": [\n1075\t      {\n1076\t        \"name\": \"Table 18: Three-way Direction Analysis\",\n1077\t        \"columns\": [\n1078\t          \"metric\",\n1079\t          \"value\"\n1080\t        ],\n1081\t        \"rows\": [\n1082\t          [\n1083\t            \"cosine(d_syc\",\n1084\t            \"d_gen_independent)\",\n1085\t            -0.72\n1086\t          ],\n1087\t          [\n1088\t            \"cosine(d_syc\",\n1089\t            \"-d_syc)\",\n1090\t            -1.0\n1091\t          ],\n1092\t          [\n1093\t            \"d_syc AUROC\",\n1094\t            0.838\n1095\t          ],\n1096\t          [\n1097\t            \"d_gen independent AUROC\",\n1098\t            0.761\n1099\t          ],\n1100\t          [\n1101\t            \"R2 w/ independent d_gen NoF\",\n1102\t            0.221\n1103\t          ],\n1104\t          [\n1105\t            \"R2 w/ independent d_gen WRR\",\n1106\t            0.591\n1107\t          ]\n1108\t        ]\n1109\t      }\n1110\t    ],\n1111\t    \"figures\": [],\n1112\t    \"analysis\": \"三方 baseline 确认 binary design 的局限性是温和的（cosine=-0.72 而非 -1.0）。 放在 appendix 作为 supplementary analysis。主论文中提及 rank-based R2 的设计选择 并引用此 appendix 作为 justification。\\n\\n\\nd_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine 为 -0.72（而非理论退化值 -1.0）， 确认 binary design 中的 d_gen=-d_syc 假设虽然不精确但也不致命。 两个方向之间存在 ~44° 的夹角（arccos(-0.72)≈136°），说明 sycophantic 和 genuine 方向不是完全相反的——它们共享大部分对比信号但有 ~28% 的独立分量。 独立 d_gen 的 AUROC（0.761）低于 d_syc（0.838），因为 genuine revision 的表征信号 更弱且更分散——模型对\\\"被正确说服\\\"的内部表征不如\\\"迎合施压\\\"清晰。 用独立 d_gen 重新训练 R2 后，NoF 几乎不变（0.221 vs 0.218）但 WRR 微升（0.591 vs 0.584）， 改善仅 0.7pp——不值得增加方法复杂度。 结论：S1 rank-based R2 设计是合理的折衷，three-way design 可留作 future work。\\n\"\n1113\t  },\n1114\t  {\n1115\t    \"name\": \"continuous_probe_baseline\",\n1116\t    \"description\": \"Continuous Probe Baseline：用 logistic regression 概率值作为 reward 信号， 隔离\\\"方向性 vs 连续性\\\"的贡献。\\n\",\n1117\t    \"results\": {\n1118\t      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.224,\n1119\t      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.015,\n1120\t      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.726,\n1121\t      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.018,\n1122\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.579,\n1123\t      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.023,\n1124\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.178,\n1125\t      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.017,\n1126\t      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.731,\n1127\t      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.022,\n1128\t      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.44,\n1129\t      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.46,\n1130\t      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.627,\n1131\t      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.6,\n1132\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_diff_pp\": -0.6,\n1133\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_diff_pp\": 0.7,\n1134\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.381,\n1135\t      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_p_value\": 0.318\n1136\t    },\n1137\t    \"tables\": [\n1138\t      {\n1139\t        \"name\": \"Table 19: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Head-to-Head\",\n1140\t        \"columns\": [\n1141\t          \"metric\",\n1142\t          \"continuous_probe\",\n1143\t          \"dc_grpo\",\n1144\t          \"diff_pp\",\n1145\t          \"p_value\"\n1146\t        ],\n1147\t        \"rows\": [\n1148\t          [\n1149\t            \"NoF ↓\",\n1150\t            0.224,\n1151\t            0.218,\n1152\t            -0.6,\n1153\t            0.381\n1154\t          ],\n1155\t          [\n1156\t            \"WRR ↑\",\n1157\t            0.579,\n1158\t            0.584,\n1159\t            0.5,\n1160\t            0.412\n1161\t          ],\n1162\t          [\n1163\t            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n1164\t            0.731,\n1165\t            0.738,\n1166\t            0.7,\n1167\t            0.318\n1168\t          ],\n1169\t          [\n1170\t            \"MT-Bench\",\n1171\t            7.44,\n1172\t            7.42,\n1173\t            -0.02,\n1174\t            0.891\n1175\t          ]\n1176\t        ]\n1177\t      },\n1178\t      {\n1179\t        \"name\": \"Table 20: Representation-level Methods Comparison\",\n1180\t        \"columns\": [\n1181\t          \"method\",\n1182\t          \"signal_type\",\n1183\t          \"nof\",\n1184\t          \"rc_auc\",\n1185\t          \"vs_r3only_rcauc_pp\"\n1186\t        ],\n1187\t        \"rows\": [\n1188\t          [\n1189\t            \"R3-only\",\n1190\t            \"behavioral\",\n1191\t            0.291,\n1192\t            0.641,\n1193\t            \"—\"\n1194\t          ],\n1195\t          [\n1196\t            \"Binary Probe\",\n1197\t            \"repr, discrete\",\n1198\t            0.239,\n1199\t            0.718,\n1200\t            7.7\n1201\t          ],\n1202\t          [\n1203\t            \"Continuous Probe\",\n1204\t            \"repr, continuous\",\n1205\t            0.224,\n1206\t            0.731,\n1207\t            9.0\n1208\t          ],\n1209\t          [\n1210\t            \"DC-GRPO\",\n1211\t            \"repr, directional\",\n1212\t            0.218,\n1213\t            0.738,\n1214\t            9.7\n1215\t          ]\n1216\t        ]\n1217\t      }\n1218\t    ],\n1219\t    \"figures\": [],\n1220\t    \"analysis\": \"Continuous Probe 是 median 档的 smoking gun：它证明 DC-GRPO 的优势主要来自 \\\"在训练 reward 中引入表征层连续信号\\\"这一设计选择，而非 d_syc 方向投影的特定几何。 论文叙事必须调整：Claim 2 从\\\"directional decomposition improves GRPO\\\"改为 \\\"representation-level continuous reward signals improve GRPO, and directional projection is one principled instantiation with interpretability advantages\\\"。 方向投影的独特卖点转向可解释性（方向有明确的几何含义）和分析工具价值（R1-R3 disagreement）， 而非训练效果的独占优势。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档最关键的实验结果。Continuous Probe 的 NoF（0.224）与 DC-GRPO（0.218） 差距仅 0.6pp（p=0.381），RC-AUC 差距仅 0.7pp（p=0.318）——完全不显著。 这意味着 DC-GRPO 相对 Binary Probe 的优势（~2pp NoF）几乎完全来自信号的连续性 （logistic regression 概率 vs binary 0/1），而非方向投影的几何特性。 logistic regression 在与 d_syc 相同的激活空间上训练，其决策超平面与 d_syc 高度相关 （cosine ≈ 0.89），但它通过 sigmoid 输出提供了平滑的概率 gradient， 与方向投影的连续值起到了几乎等价的作用。 这迫使论文叙事转向：不是\\\"方向投影是关键\\\"，而是\\\"表征层连续信号是关键， 方向投影是提取该信号的一种有效方法\\\"。 DC-GRPO 仍有微弱数值优势，可能来自方向投影对 outlier 的鲁棒性更好 （投影是线性的，不受 sigmoid 饱和影响），但这个差异不足以支撑显著性 claim。\\n\"\n1221\t  },\n1222\t  {\n1223\t    \"name\": \"reward_weight_sensitivity\",\n1224\t    \"description\": \"测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\\n\",\n1225\t    \"results\": {\n1226\t      \"config_default_w1_0.3_w2_0.2_w3_0.5\": {\n1227\t        \"nof\": 0.218,\n1228\t        \"wrr\": 0.584,\n1229\t        \"rc_auc\": 0.738\n1230\t      },\n1231\t      \"config_r1_dominant_w1_0.6_w2_0.1_w3_0.3\": {\n1232\t        \"nof\": 0.207,\n1233\t        \"wrr\": 0.521,\n1234\t        \"rc_auc\": 0.694\n1235\t      },\n1236\t      \"config_equal_w1_0.33_w2_0.33_w3_0.34\": {\n1237\t        \"nof\": 0.226,\n1238\t        \"wrr\": 0.573,\n1239\t        \"rc_auc\": 0.728\n1240\t      },\n1241\t      \"config_r3_dominant_w1_0.1_w2_0.1_w3_0.8\": {\n1242\t        \"nof\": 0.274,\n1243\t        \"wrr\": 0.562,\n1244\t        \"rc_auc\": 0.661\n1245\t      },\n1246\t      \"config_r2_enhanced_w1_0.2_w2_0.4_w3_0.4\": {\n1247\t        \"nof\": 0.231,\n1248\t        \"wrr\": 0.569,\n1249\t        \"rc_auc\": 0.722\n1250\t      },\n1251\t      \"nof_range_across_configs_pp\": 6.7,\n1252\t      \"wrr_range_across_configs_pp\": 6.3,\n1253\t      \"rc_auc_range_across_configs_pp\": 7.7,\n1254\t      \"best_rc_auc_config\": \"default\",\n1255\t      \"worst_rc_auc_config\": \"r3_dominant\"\n1256\t    },\n1257\t    \"tables\": [\n1258\t      {\n1259\t        \"name\": \"Table 21: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis\",\n1260\t        \"columns\": [\n1261\t          \"config\",\n1262\t          \"w1\",\n1263\t          \"w2\",\n1264\t          \"w3\",\n1265\t          \"nof\",\n1266\t          \"wrr\",\n1267\t          \"rc_auc\"\n1268\t        ],\n1269\t        \"rows\": [\n1270\t          [\n1271\t            \"R1-dominant\",\n1272\t            0.6,\n1273\t            0.1,\n1274\t            0.3,\n1275\t            0.207,\n1276\t            0.521,\n1277\t            0.694\n1278\t          ],\n1279\t          [\n1280\t            \"Default\",\n1281\t            0.3,\n1282\t            0.2,\n1283\t            0.5,\n1284\t            0.218,\n1285\t            0.584,\n1286\t            0.738\n1287\t          ],\n1288\t          [\n1289\t            \"Equal\",\n1290\t            0.33,\n1291\t            0.33,\n1292\t            0.34,\n1293\t            0.226,\n1294\t            0.573,\n1295\t            0.728\n1296\t          ],\n1297\t          [\n1298\t            \"R2-enhanced\",\n1299\t            0.2,\n1300\t            0.4,\n1301\t            0.4,\n1302\t            0.231,\n1303\t            0.569,\n1304\t            0.722\n1305\t          ],\n1306\t          [\n1307\t            \"R3-dominant\",\n1308\t            0.1,\n1309\t            0.1,\n1310\t            0.8,\n1311\t            0.274,\n1312\t            0.562,\n1313\t            0.661\n1314\t          ]\n1315\t        ]\n1316\t      },\n1317\t      {\n1318\t        \"name\": \"Table 22: Sensitivity Summary\",\n1319\t        \"columns\": [\n1320\t          \"metric\",\n1321\t          \"min\",\n1322\t          \"max\",\n1323\t          \"range_pp\",\n1324\t          \"best_config\"\n1325\t        ],\n1326\t        \"rows\": [\n1327\t          [\n1328\t            \"NoF\",\n1329\t            0.207,\n1330\t            0.274,\n1331\t            6.7,\n1332\t            \"R1-dominant\"\n1333\t          ],\n1334\t          [\n1335\t            \"WRR\",\n1336\t            0.521,\n1337\t            0.584,\n1338\t            6.3,\n1339\t            \"Default\"\n1340\t          ],\n1341\t          [\n1342\t            \"RC-AUC\",\n1343\t            0.661,\n1344\t            0.738,\n1345\t            7.7,\n1346\t            \"Default\"\n1347\t          ]\n1348\t        ]\n1349\t      }\n1350\t    ],\n1351\t    \"figures\": [],\n1352\t    \"analysis\": \"权重敏感度在可接受范围内（RC-AUC 变化 7.7pp），default 配置接近最优。 论文中报告为\\\"中等鲁棒性\\\"：合理范围内结果稳定，但极端权重导致退化。 建议在 appendix 提供完整表格，主论文仅提及\\\"sensitivity analysis confirms robustness within w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.4], w3 ∈ [0.3, 0.5]\\\"。 如果 reviewer 追问 weight tuning，此实验是充分的防御。\\n\\nNoF 范围 6.7pp（0.207-0.274），在 4-8pp 预期区间内，表明中等敏感度。 R1-dominant 配置在 NoF 上最佳（0.207）但 WRR 崩溃（0.521），再次确认 R1 过度惩罚修正行为。 R3-dominant 配置最差（NoF 0.274），接近 R3-only baseline（0.291）， 说明当 R1 权重过低时表征信号的贡献被淹没。 Default 配置在 RC-AUC 上最佳（0.738），equal 配置接近（0.728）， 说明 default 权重选择虽无理论 justification 但经验上接近最优。 关键发现：(1) 只要 R1 权重 ≥ 0.2 且 R3 权重 ≥ 0.3，RC-AUC 都在 0.69+ 范围内—— 方法对权重选择中等鲁棒；(2) 极端配置（R1>0.5 或 R3>0.7）才导致显著退化。 这足以在论文中声称\\\"结果对合理权重范围内的选择鲁棒\\\"。\\n\"\n1353\t  }\n1354\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14d4612e-ac34-424e-8b81-3d8018208e76","uuid":"c6e5f9af-c6ad-4d17-8caf-85865503f970","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:31:23.120Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125925/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"calibration_data_expansion\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展 v2.1 风格控制校准数据至 200 pairs（80 weak + 60 medium + 60 strong）， 重新计算 d_syc 方向并评估 AUROC（5-fold CV + bootstrap CI）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"auroc_5fold_mean\": 0.843,\n      \"auroc_5fold_std\": 0.018,\n      \"auroc_bootstrap_ci_95\": [\n        0.812,\n        0.874\n      ],\n      \"auroc_bootstrap_ci_width\": 0.062,\n      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_weak\": 0.871,\n      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_medium\": 0.832,\n      \"auroc_by_evidence_strength_strong\": 0.809,\n      \"best_layer\": \"L18\",\n      \"layer_progression_random_to_peak\": \"L0=0.51, L8=0.63, L14=0.74, L18=0.843, L22=0.831, L27=0.812\",\n      \"extraction_position_asst_first_auroc\": 0.843,\n      \"extraction_position_user_last_auroc\": 0.791\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Calibration AUROC by Evidence Strength and Layer\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"layer\",\n          \"weak_auroc\",\n          \"medium_auroc\",\n          \"strong_auroc\",\n          \"overall_auroc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"L0\",\n            0.52,\n            0.5,\n            0.51,\n            0.51\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L8\",\n            0.67,\n            0.62,\n            0.58,\n            0.63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L14\",\n            0.79,\n            0.73,\n            0.68,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L18\",\n            0.87,\n            0.83,\n            0.81,\n            0.843\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L22\",\n            0.86,\n            0.82,\n            0.79,\n            0.831\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L27\",\n            0.84,\n            0.8,\n            0.77,\n            0.812\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Bootstrap CI Summary (1000 resamples)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"mean_auroc\",\n            0.843\n          ],\n          [\n            \"std\",\n            0.018\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ci_95_lower\",\n            0.812\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ci_95_upper\",\n            0.874\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ci_width\",\n            0.062\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"通过 0.80 gate（CI 下界 0.812 > 0.80），但处于\\\"继续但降低 R1 权重\\\"区间而非\\\"全速推进\\\"区间。 evidence-strength 梯度揭示 d_syc 的本质局限：在 strong evidence 下方向判别力下降， 因为 genuine revision 和 sycophantic capitulation 的内部表征差异被压缩。 这直接预示 DC-GRPO 在 WRR 指标上的有限提升——R1 在该场景下噪声较大。 建议 R1 权重从原定 0.3 降至 0.2，增强 R3 安全网。\\n\\n\\n200 pairs 将 MVP 的 50-pair σ=0.054 压缩至 ~0.03 级别，AUROC 从 0.826 小幅提升至 0.843， 主要来自 medium/strong evidence 对分类边界的细化。但 CI 宽度仍在 0.06 附近——200 pairs 足以通过 0.80 gate 但远不够将 CI 压至 0.03 以下。weak evidence 的 AUROC 最高（0.871），因为 sycophantic capitulation 在 弱证据下信号最纯粹（模型内部知道证据不足但仍迎合）；strong evidence 下 AUROC 降至 0.809，因为 genuine revision 和 capitulation 在强证据场景中激活模式更接近——模型确实在更新信念，方向信号混叠。 这一模式预示了 median 档的核心问题：d_syc 捕获的不纯粹是\\\"谄媚方向\\\"，而是混合了认知不确定性信号。 层进展确认 mid-layer emergence（L14-18 是关键跃升区间），但 peak 略移至 L18 而非 MVP 的 L19， 反映更大数据集下更精确的层定位。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"dc_grpo_main\",\n    \"description\": \"DC-GRPO 完整训练：R1(方向投影) + R2(rank-based contrastive) + R3(NLI behavioral)， Qwen3-8B + LoRA rank 64，3 seeds。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.218,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.014,\n      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.731,\n      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.019,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.584,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.022,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.173,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.016,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.738,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.021,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.42,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.48,\n      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.627,\n      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.6,\n      \"best_step\": 6500,\n      \"training_loss_final\": 0.342,\n      \"early_stop_triggered\": false,\n      \"r1_reward_mean_final\": 0.41,\n      \"r2_reward_mean_final\": 0.28,\n      \"r3_reward_mean_final\": 0.63\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: DC-GRPO Training Metrics by Checkpoint (seed average)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"step\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"wrr\",\n          \"rc_auc\",\n          \"mt_bench\",\n          \"direction_cosine_w_init\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1000,\n            0.312,\n            0.611,\n            0.652,\n            7.78,\n            0.97\n          ],\n          [\n            2000,\n            0.271,\n            0.603,\n            0.691,\n            7.65,\n            0.93\n          ],\n          [\n            3000,\n            0.248,\n            0.594,\n            0.714,\n            7.55,\n            0.89\n          ],\n          [\n            4000,\n            0.234,\n            0.589,\n            0.728,\n            7.48,\n            0.85\n          ],\n          [\n            5000,\n            0.225,\n            0.586,\n            0.735,\n            7.44,\n            0.82\n          ],\n          [\n            6000,\n            0.22,\n            0.585,\n            0.737,\n            7.43,\n            0.8\n          ],\n          [\n            6500,\n            0.218,\n            0.584,\n            0.738,\n            7.42,\n            0.79\n          ],\n          [\n            7000,\n            0.219,\n            0.58,\n            0.736,\n            7.41,\n            0.78\n          ],\n          [\n            8000,\n            0.221,\n            0.574,\n            0.732,\n            7.39,\n            0.76\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DC-GRPO 核心结果：NoF 改善显著（vs R3-only ~10pp），但 WRR 改善有限（~2-4pp）。 这一不均匀性是 median 档的标志性特征——d_syc 更擅长识别 sycophantic capitulation 而非正确区分 warranted revision，导致\\\"过度抵抗\\\"的副作用。 RC-AUC 作为复合指标成功捕获了整体改善，是最佳展示指标。\\n\\n\\nDC-GRPO 在 median 档下完成训练但表现中规中矩。NoF 0.218 显著优于 R3-only（预期 ~0.29）， 约 10pp 绝对改善，但 WRR 仅 0.584——说明 R1 在区分 warranted revision 时噪声较大， 导致部分应修正的场景被保守地抑制。这正是 exp-001 中 strong evidence AUROC 下降的下游体现： d_syc 在\\\"模型确实该改变信念\\\"时信号不纯，R1 给出的负奖励过多地惩罚了正当修正。 RC-AUC 0.738 是亮点——复合指标上的优势来自 R1 同时拉低了 NoF（主贡献）和维持了中等 WRR， 但两个单项指标的改善不均匀。训练在 6500 步附近效果最佳但未触发 early stop， 后 1500 步 NoF 几乎不变但 WRR 微降，暗示方向信号在训练后期被过度拟合。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.48 在可接受范围内，MMLU 损失 0.6pp 可忽略。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"r3_only_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"R3-only GRPO baseline，仅用 NLI behavioral reward，3 seeds。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.291,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.018,\n      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.682,\n      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.021,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.558,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.025,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.237,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.019,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.641,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.024,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.61,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.29,\n      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.63,\n      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: R3-only Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"wrr\",\n          \"rc_auc\",\n          \"mt_bench\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"seed_0\",\n            0.283,\n            0.571,\n            0.655,\n            7.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_1\",\n            0.298,\n            0.542,\n            0.628,\n            7.63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_2\",\n            0.292,\n            0.561,\n            0.64,\n            7.62\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mean_std\",\n            \"0.291±0.018\",\n            \"0.558±0.025\",\n            \"0.641±0.024\",\n            \"7.61±0.03\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"R3-only 确认了纯行为 reward 的局限：NoF 不够低（漏掉隐性迎合），WRR 不够高（不区分修正类型）。 DC-GRPO 的 NoF 优势（~7pp）达到统计显著（p~0.02），但 WRR 优势（~2.6pp）不显著（p~0.15）。 RC-AUC 差异（~10pp）是最强对比点。\\n\\n\\nR3-only 是\\\"行为信号天花板\\\"baseline。NLI reward 能捕获表面不一致但无法深入表征层， 导致 NoF 改善有限（0.291 vs vanilla ~0.38）——它惩罚了最明显的迎合但漏掉了表面合理但 内部 sycophantic 的回复。WRR 0.558 与 DC-GRPO（0.584）差距不大，说明 R3 本身 不太区分修正类型——它对所有\\\"改变答案\\\"行为施加了近似均匀的惩罚。 RC-AUC 0.641 显著低于 DC-GRPO 的 0.738（~10pp），这是论文最核心的对比数据。 MT-Bench 降幅更小（0.29 vs 0.48），因为 R3-only 的训练信号更保守，对通用能力的扰动更小。 这构成一个 tradeoff 论点：DC-GRPO 用 0.2 分 MT-Bench 换取 ~10pp RC-AUC 提升。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"act_style_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"ACT-style undifferentiated consistency baseline，L2 activation consistency loss，3 seeds。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.264,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.02,\n      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.698,\n      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.023,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.502,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.028,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.204,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.021,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.648,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.027,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.31,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.59,\n      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.621,\n      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: ACT Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"wrr\",\n          \"rc_auc\",\n          \"mt_bench\",\n          \"mmlu\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"seed_0\",\n            0.252,\n            0.518,\n            0.663,\n            7.28,\n            0.618\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_1\",\n            0.274,\n            0.488,\n            0.634,\n            7.33,\n            0.623\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_2\",\n            0.266,\n            0.5,\n            0.647,\n            7.32,\n            0.622\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mean_std\",\n            \"0.264±0.020\",\n            \"0.502±0.028\",\n            \"0.648±0.027\",\n            \"7.31±0.03\",\n            \"0.621±0.003\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ACT 是\\\"用大锤拍苍蝇\\\"的典型：NoF 改善来自冻结行为，代价是 WRR 大幅下降和通用能力损失。 DC-GRPO 在所有复合指标上胜出，且通用能力损失更小。论文中 ACT 对比支撑 \\\"有方向的表征约束 > 无方向的表征约束\\\"叙事。\\n\\n\\nACT 在 NoF 上表现不错（0.264），甚至接近 DC-GRPO（0.218），因为 undifferentiated consistency 确实能阻止模型在施压下改变行为——但它不区分方向，所以 WRR 严重受损（0.502）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.584）和 R3-only（0.558）。ACT 本质上将模型冻结为\\\"不轻易改变答案\\\"， 这在减少迎合的同时也抑制了正当修正。RC-AUC 0.648 仅略优于 R3-only（0.641）， 远低于 DC-GRPO（0.738）——ACT 在 tradeoff 曲线上不如 DC-GRPO。 MT-Bench 降幅 0.59 和 MMLU 损失 1.2pp 都偏高，因为 L2 consistency loss 对通用能力有副作用—— 它不仅阻止 sycophantic 变化，也抑制了任何合理的表征更新。 这是 DC-GRPO 相对 ACT 的最清晰叙事：\\\"有方向的表征约束优于无方向的表征约束\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"所有模型在所有 benchmark 上的完整评估，包括 SYCON Bench、SycophancyEval、MT-Bench、MMLU 和项目特有指标。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dc_grpo_sycon_nof\": 0.218,\n      \"dc_grpo_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.724,\n      \"dc_grpo_mt_bench\": 7.42,\n      \"dc_grpo_mmlu\": 0.627,\n      \"dc_grpo_rc_auc\": 0.738,\n      \"r3_only_sycon_nof\": 0.291,\n      \"r3_only_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.681,\n      \"r3_only_mt_bench\": 7.61,\n      \"r3_only_mmlu\": 0.63,\n      \"r3_only_rc_auc\": 0.641,\n      \"act_sycon_nof\": 0.264,\n      \"act_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.703,\n      \"act_mt_bench\": 7.31,\n      \"act_mmlu\": 0.621,\n      \"act_rc_auc\": 0.648,\n      \"binary_probe_sycon_nof\": 0.239,\n      \"binary_probe_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.712,\n      \"binary_probe_mt_bench\": 7.47,\n      \"binary_probe_mmlu\": 0.628,\n      \"binary_probe_rc_auc\": 0.718,\n      \"vanilla_sycon_nof\": 0.382,\n      \"vanilla_sycophancy_eval_accuracy\": 0.623,\n      \"vanilla_mt_bench\": 7.9,\n      \"vanilla_mmlu\": 0.633,\n      \"vanilla_rc_auc\": 0.524,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_nof_p_value\": 0.021,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_wrr_p_value\": 0.148,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_r3only_rcauc_p_value\": 0.008,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.089,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_binary_probe_rcauc_p_value\": 0.042,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.381\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Full Evaluation Summary (all methods)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"nof_↓\",\n          \"wrr_↑\",\n          \"rc_auc_↑\",\n          \"syceval_acc_↑\",\n          \"mt_bench\",\n          \"mmlu\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Vanilla\",\n            0.382,\n            0.537,\n            0.524,\n            0.623,\n            7.9,\n            0.633\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R3-only\",\n            0.291,\n            0.558,\n            0.641,\n            0.681,\n            7.61,\n            0.63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ACT-style\",\n            0.264,\n            0.502,\n            0.648,\n            0.703,\n            7.31,\n            0.621\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary Probe\",\n            0.239,\n            0.572,\n            0.718,\n            0.712,\n            7.47,\n            0.628\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Continuous Probe\",\n            0.224,\n            0.579,\n            0.731,\n            0.719,\n            7.44,\n            0.627\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO\",\n            0.218,\n            0.584,\n            0.738,\n            0.724,\n            7.42,\n            0.627\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Statistical Significance (paired bootstrap, p-values)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"comparison\",\n          \"nof_p\",\n          \"wrr_p\",\n          \"rc_auc_p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO vs R3-only\",\n            0.021,\n            0.148,\n            0.008\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO vs ACT\",\n            0.034,\n            0.003,\n            0.006\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe\",\n            0.089,\n            0.231,\n            0.042\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO vs Continuous Probe\",\n            0.381,\n            0.412,\n            0.318\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary Probe vs R3-only\",\n            0.041,\n            0.278,\n            0.012\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"主表是论文核心。叙事策略：(1) 所有表征 reward 方法 (DC-GRPO, Continuous Probe, Binary Probe) 均优于 R3-only，证明\\\"representation-level signals improve GRPO\\\"；(2) DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上最佳， 但 vs Continuous Probe 差异不显著——方向几何的独立贡献无法隔离；(3) RC-AUC 作为评估框架 比任何单项指标更好地捕获 tradeoff，是独立贡献。\\n\\n\\n完整评估暴露了 median 档的核心 pattern：DC-GRPO 在 RC-AUC 上全面领先（0.738 vs 次佳 Binary Probe 0.718）， 但 head-to-head 单项对比中只有 NoF vs R3-only 达到传统显著性（p=0.021）。 DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差异 (0.218 vs 0.239, ~2pp) 不显著（p=0.089）， 这是 median 档的关键 weakness——无法证明方向投影优于 binary probe。 SycophancyEval 上的趋势与 SYCON 一致但差距更小，因为该 benchmark 偏向 single-turn。 Vanilla baseline 在 NoF 上最差（0.382）但通用能力最强（MT-Bench 7.90）， 为所有训练方法提供了上界参照。MT-Bench 和 MMLU 退化均在可接受范围内， DC-GRPO 未比 Binary Probe 产生更多通用能力损失。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"direction_stability_monitoring\",\n    \"description\": \"训练过程中监控 d_syc 方向稳定性，每 500 步报告 cosine similarity、held-out AUROC、漂移速率。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cosine_step_500\": 0.96,\n      \"cosine_step_1000\": 0.93,\n      \"cosine_step_2000\": 0.88,\n      \"cosine_step_3000\": 0.85,\n      \"cosine_step_4000\": 0.82,\n      \"cosine_step_5000\": 0.8,\n      \"cosine_step_6000\": 0.78,\n      \"cosine_step_7000\": 0.77,\n      \"cosine_step_8000\": 0.76,\n      \"cosine_minimum\": 0.76,\n      \"recalibration_triggered_count\": 0,\n      \"recalibration_threshold\": 0.7,\n      \"held_out_auroc_step_0\": 0.843,\n      \"held_out_auroc_step_4000\": 0.814,\n      \"held_out_auroc_step_8000\": 0.791,\n      \"auroc_drift_total\": -0.052\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Direction Stability During Training\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"step\",\n          \"cosine_w_init\",\n          \"held_out_auroc\",\n          \"recalibrated\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0,\n            1.0,\n            0.843,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            500,\n            0.96,\n            0.839,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            1000,\n            0.93,\n            0.833,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            2000,\n            0.88,\n            0.825,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            3000,\n            0.85,\n            0.819,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            4000,\n            0.82,\n            0.814,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            5000,\n            0.8,\n            0.806,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            6000,\n            0.78,\n            0.798,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            7000,\n            0.77,\n            0.794,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            8000,\n            0.76,\n            0.791,\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"方向漂移是真实现象但可控。论文需报告：(1) 方向在训练中持续旋转，cosine 降至 ~0.76； (2) 定期重校准是方法的必要组成部分，不是可选优化； (3) AUROC 退化（~5pp）小于 cosine 变化暗示的幅度，因为判别超平面比方向本身更稳定。 这增加了方法的复杂度但也提供了一个 analysis point。\\n\\n\\n方向在训练过程中持续漂移但未触发 0.70 重校准阈值——cosine 从初始 1.0 逐步降至 0.76。 前 2000 步漂移最快（0.88），因为 LoRA 适配改变了模型表征空间的几何结构； 4000 步后减速（0.82→0.76），因为 LoRA 参数趋于收敛。held-out AUROC 从 0.843 降至 0.791， 说明初始方向在训练后期已不完全对准当前模型的 sycophancy 方向—— 如果不引入重校准机制，R1 信号质量在训练后期退化约 5pp AUROC。 实际的 500 步重校准机制使用当前模型重算方向，缓解了这一退化， 但增加了方法的复杂度。cosine 未降至 0.70 以下说明方向并未\\\"崩溃\\\"， 只是缓慢旋转——对论文而言这是好消息（方向真实存在且持续）， 但也意味着必须报告重校准机制作为方法的必要组成部分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"r1_r3_disagreement_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"分析 R1 和 R3 给出不同信号的频率和模式，特别关注 R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct 的案例。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_samples_analyzed\": 4800,\n      \"agreement_rate\": 0.924,\n      \"disagreement_rate\": 0.076,\n      \"r1_syc_r3_correct_count\": 217,\n      \"r1_syc_r3_correct_rate\": 0.045,\n      \"r1_correct_r3_syc_count\": 148,\n      \"r1_correct_r3_syc_rate\": 0.031,\n      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn2\": 0.058,\n      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn3\": 0.081,\n      \"disagreement_by_turn_depth_turn4plus\": 0.109,\n      \"disagreement_by_evidence_weak\": 0.092,\n      \"disagreement_by_evidence_medium\": 0.073,\n      \"disagreement_by_evidence_strong\": 0.061\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: R1-R3 Disagreement Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"category\",\n          \"count\",\n          \"rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Total samples\",\n            4800,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Full agreement\",\n            4435,\n            0.924\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R1=syc & R3=correct\",\n            217,\n            0.045\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R1=correct & R3=syc\",\n            148,\n            0.031\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total disagreement\",\n            365,\n            0.076\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Disagreement Rate by Turn Depth\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"turn_depth\",\n          \"n_samples\",\n          \"disagreement_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Turn 2\",\n            1920,\n            0.058\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Turn 3\",\n            1680,\n            0.081\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Turn 4+\",\n            1200,\n            0.109\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7.6% disagreement 支持在 analysis subsection 中报告定性 pattern，但不足以列为 top-level contribution。 叙事策略：(1) disagreement 存在且非随机（与 turn depth 和 evidence strength 相关）； (2) 这提供了\\\"表征层和行为层看到不同图景\\\"的 evidence，但无法量化其中多少是 true masked sycophancy vs R1/R3 各自的噪声；(3) 诚实报告，不过度解读。\\n\\n\\n7.6% 总体 disagreement 落在 5-10% 区间内，满足 Claim 3 的最低门槛（> 5%）。 \\\"R1 认为 sycophantic 但 R3 认为 correct\\\"（masked sycophancy 候选）占 4.5%—— 这是最有叙事价值的子集，但比例偏低，难以作为\\\"方向信号独立发现隐藏迎合\\\"的强论据。 R1-correct/R3-syc（R3 误判）占 3.1%，说明 R3 的 NLI 评分器也有系统性偏差。 Disagreement 随 turn depth 增加（turn 4+ 达 10.9%），符合直觉：深层对话中 表面行为更难评估（R3 困难增加）而内部表征信号相对稳定（R1 优势显现）。 Weak evidence 场景 disagreement 最高（9.2%），因为弱证据下 R3 的 NLI 判断更模糊。 总体而言：disagreement 存在且有有趣的结构化 pattern，但比例不足以支撑 \\\"方向投影是检测 masked sycophancy 的关键工具\\\"这一强 claim。 适合作为 analysis subsection 报告，提供定性洞察。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"binary_probe_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Binary Probe Penalty baseline，binary linear probe on policy model activations，3 seeds。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.239,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.016,\n      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.718,\n      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.02,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.572,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.024,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.191,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.018,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.718,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.023,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.47,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.43,\n      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.628,\n      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Binary Probe Baseline Results (3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"seed\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"wrr\",\n          \"rc_auc\",\n          \"mt_bench\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"seed_0\",\n            0.231,\n            0.582,\n            0.727,\n            7.44\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_1\",\n            0.248,\n            0.558,\n            0.706,\n            7.49\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed_2\",\n            0.238,\n            0.576,\n            0.721,\n            7.48\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mean_std\",\n            \"0.239±0.016\",\n            \"0.572±0.024\",\n            \"0.718±0.023\",\n            \"7.47±0.03\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Binary Probe 对比揭示 DC-GRPO 的优势来源不明确。论文不能简单声称 \\\"方向投影优于 binary probe\\\"——需要通过 exp-014 (continuous probe) 进一步分解。 但 Binary Probe 本身显著优于 R3-only（NoF p=0.041）， 证明\\\"表征层信号有价值\\\"这一更温和的 claim。\\n\\n\\nBinary Probe 在 NoF 上达到 0.239——比 R3-only（0.291）好 ~5pp 但不如 DC-GRPO（0.218）。 DC-GRPO vs Binary Probe 的 NoF 差距仅 ~2pp（p=0.089），不显著。 这是 median 档的核心困境：binary probe 已经捕获了大部分表征层信号， 方向投影的额外贡献被 binary 分类的信息量掩盖。RC-AUC 0.718 vs DC-GRPO 0.738（~2pp 差距）， 趋势上 DC-GRPO 更好但 3 seeds 的 power 不足以达到显著。 Binary probe 的 MT-Bench 降幅（0.43）与 DC-GRPO（0.48）相当， 说明两种方法对通用能力的扰动类似。关键启示：方向投影 vs binary probe 的差异更多在于信号的连续性（gradient 更平滑）而非方向性本身。 这解释了为什么需要 exp-014 continuous probe baseline 来隔离这两个因素。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ablation_r1_only\",\n    \"description\": \"R1-only ablation，仅用方向投影 reward，从 exp-002 step 2000 分叉，短程训练 ~2000 步。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.273,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.021,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.491,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.031,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.612,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.028,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.18,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.72,\n      \"training_stable\": true,\n      \"nof_improvement_vs_vanilla_pp\": 10.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: R1-only Ablation Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"r1_only\",\n          \"dc_grpo\",\n          \"r3_only\",\n          \"vanilla\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NoF ↓\",\n            0.273,\n            0.218,\n            0.291,\n            0.382\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WRR ↑\",\n            0.491,\n            0.584,\n            0.558,\n            0.537\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n            0.612,\n            0.738,\n            0.641,\n            0.524\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MT-Bench\",\n            7.18,\n            7.42,\n            7.61,\n            7.9\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"R1-only 证明方向投影包含真实训练信号（NoF ~11pp improvement vs vanilla）， 但也证明它不能替代行为信号——R3 是必要的安全网。 论文叙事：各信号互补，DC-GRPO 的价值在于有效组合。\\n\\n\\nR1-only 能降低 NoF（0.273 vs vanilla 0.382，~11pp），证明方向信号单独有训练价值。 但 WRR 严重下降（0.491 vs vanilla 0.537），因为没有 R3 行为安全网，R1 过度惩罚了 所有\\\"改变答案\\\"行为——方向投影在 strong evidence 下的噪声直接传导为训练偏差。 RC-AUC 0.612 低于 R3-only（0.641），说明方向信号单独不如行为信号—— 但两者的组合（DC-GRPO 0.738）大幅超越任一单独信号。 MT-Bench 降幅较大（0.72），因为缺少 R3 对通用能力的隐式保护。 结论：R1 有独立贡献但不能单打独斗，需要与 R3 协同。 这支持论文的\\\"多信号组合\\\"叙事。nof_improvement ≥ 5pp，满足 exp-011 的前置条件。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"turn_depth_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"按 commitment depth (turn 2/3/4+) 分析 DC-GRPO vs baselines 的修正率变化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn2\": 0.178,\n      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn3\": 0.224,\n      \"dc_grpo_nof_turn4plus\": 0.287,\n      \"r3_only_nof_turn2\": 0.231,\n      \"r3_only_nof_turn3\": 0.298,\n      \"r3_only_nof_turn4plus\": 0.381,\n      \"act_nof_turn2\": 0.214,\n      \"act_nof_turn3\": 0.268,\n      \"act_nof_turn4plus\": 0.342,\n      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn2_pp\": 5.3,\n      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn3_pp\": 7.4,\n      \"dc_grpo_advantage_turn4plus_pp\": 9.4,\n      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn2\": 0.612,\n      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn3\": 0.578,\n      \"dc_grpo_wrr_turn4plus\": 0.541,\n      \"r3_only_wrr_turn2\": 0.589,\n      \"r3_only_wrr_turn3\": 0.551,\n      \"r3_only_wrr_turn4plus\": 0.517\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: NoF by Turn Depth (all methods)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"turn_2\",\n          \"turn_3\",\n          \"turn_4+\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Vanilla\",\n            0.318,\n            0.389,\n            0.462\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R3-only\",\n            0.231,\n            0.298,\n            0.381\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ACT\",\n            0.214,\n            0.268,\n            0.342\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary Probe\",\n            0.196,\n            0.243,\n            0.309\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO\",\n            0.178,\n            0.224,\n            0.287\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 14: DC-GRPO Advantage (pp) vs R3-only by Turn Depth\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"turn_depth\",\n          \"nof_advantage_pp\",\n          \"wrr_advantage_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Turn 2\",\n            5.3,\n            2.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Turn 3\",\n            7.4,\n            2.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Turn 4+\",\n            9.4,\n            2.4\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Turn-depth 分析是论文中\\\"多轮价值论证\\\"的关键 evidence。 DC-GRPO 的优势在深层 turns 放大 ~2× 是一个强叙事点， 支持\\\"表征层信号在行为信号困难的场景中更有价值\\\"的论点。 这部分可独立成为一个 subsection，增强论文的多轮 contribution 叙事。\\n\\n\\n所有方法的 NoF 都随 turn depth 增加（commitment 越深越难修正），但 DC-GRPO 的优势 在深层 turns 放大：turn 2 仅 ~5pp 优势，turn 4+ 扩大到 ~9pp。 这是因为深层 commitment 中行为信号（R3）的判别力下降——NLI 评分器在多轮上下文中 越来越难准确判断\\\"改变答案\\\"是否合理，而表征层信号（R1）对 turn depth 的敏感度更低 （方向投影不受表面对话长度影响）。WRR 同样随深度下降，但 DC-GRPO 在各层都维持了 相对优势（2-3pp），虽然不显著但趋势一致。 这一分析强化了\\\"多轮场景是 DC-GRPO 的甜蜜点\\\"叙事， 也回应了\\\"多轮训练是否比单轮训练更有价值\\\"的 reviewer 疑问。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ablation_r1_r2_no_r3\",\n    \"description\": \"R1+R2 无 R3 ablation，去掉行为安全网后的完整训练循环。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.252,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.024,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.483,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.033,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.628,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.03,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.14,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.76,\n      \"surface_inconsistency_rate\": 0.087\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 15: R1+R2 (no R3) Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"r1+r2\",\n          \"r1_only\",\n          \"dc_grpo_full\",\n          \"r3_only\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NoF ↓\",\n            0.252,\n            0.273,\n            0.218,\n            0.291\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WRR ↑\",\n            0.483,\n            0.491,\n            0.584,\n            0.558\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n            0.628,\n            0.612,\n            0.738,\n            0.641\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Surface inconsistency\",\n            0.087,\n            0.063,\n            0.012,\n            0.008\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"R1+R2 vs DC-GRPO 的对比清晰展示了 R3 的双重作用：(1) 防止表面不一致； (2) 保护 warranted revision。这个 ablation 在论文中支持\\\"三信号设计\\\"的 justification， 但篇幅不宜过长——放在 appendix 中即可。\\n\\n\\nR1+R2 无 R3 验证了一个有趣的现象：模型在表征层被引导向\\\"正确方向\\\"， 但缺少行为安全网后出现 8.7% 的\\\"表面不一致\\\"输出——模型内部判断正确但表达方式 不连贯或自相矛盾。这是因为 R1+R2 只优化内部表征而不约束输出格式。 NoF 0.252 比 R1-only 的 0.273 好（R2 提供了额外的对比学习信号）， 但 WRR 进一步恶化（0.483 vs R1-only 0.491），因为 R2 的 rank-based contrastive 对\\\"改变 vs 不改变\\\"的约束更强。整体 RC-AUC 0.628 不如 R3-only（0.641）， 确认 R3 不仅是安全网，而且是有效信号源。 这一实验的主要价值在于证明 R3 的必要性和三信号协同的设计合理性。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_model_transfer\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Llama-3-8B 上测试 d_syc 方向计算和部分 DC-GRPO 训练。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"phase_a_auroc\": 0.778,\n      \"phase_a_auroc_ci\": [\n        0.742,\n        0.814\n      ],\n      \"phase_a_best_layer\": \"L17\",\n      \"phase_a_gate_passed\": true,\n      \"phase_b_nof\": 0.248,\n      \"phase_b_wrr\": 0.561,\n      \"phase_b_rc_auc\": 0.698,\n      \"phase_b_steps\": 3000,\n      \"phase_b_mt_bench\": 7.28,\n      \"cross_model_direction_cosine\": 0.31,\n      \"direction_transfer_auroc\": 0.62\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 16: Cross-Model Transfer (Llama-3-8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"llama_3_8b\",\n          \"qwen3_8b\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Calibration AUROC\",\n            0.778,\n            0.843\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best layer\",\n            \"L17\",\n            \"L18\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO NoF\",\n            0.248,\n            0.218\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO WRR\",\n            0.561,\n            0.584\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO RC-AUC\",\n            0.698,\n            0.738\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MT-Bench\",\n            7.28,\n            7.42\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 17: Direction Transfer Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"direction_source\",\n          \"evaluated_on\",\n          \"auroc\",\n          \"cosine_w_native\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            0.843,\n            1.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama3\",\n            \"Llama3\",\n            0.778,\n            1.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"Llama3\",\n            0.62,\n            0.31\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama3\",\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            0.641,\n            0.31\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨模型实验部分回应\\\"single model\\\"critique。叙事：(1) DC-GRPO 框架跨模型有效（Llama3 也能训练出 更好的 sycophancy-revision tradeoff）；(2) 方向本身是模型特定的（cosine 0.31）， 但表征空间中\\\"存在可判别方向\\\"的现象是跨模型的；(3) 仍需在每个模型上独立校准。 这是一个 honest limitations 点而非 weakness——框架通用性有，但不是 plug-and-play。\\n\\n\\nPhase A AUROC 0.778 通过 0.75 gate，但低于 Qwen3-8B 的 0.843——约 6.5pp 差距。 这是预期的：不同模型族的表征空间几何不同，d_syc 的具体表现依赖于训练数据和架构。 Peak layer 在 L17（Qwen3 在 L18），差异很小，支持\\\"mid-layer emergence is universal\\\"叙事。 Phase B 短程训练后 NoF 0.248（vs Qwen3 的 0.218，~3pp 差距），RC-AUC 0.698（vs 0.738，~4pp 差距）， 说明 DC-GRPO 框架跨模型可迁移但需要模型特定的方向校准——不能直接搬运 Qwen3 的 d_syc。 跨模型方向的 cosine similarity 仅 0.31，证实方向是模型特定的； 但直接用 Qwen3 方向在 Llama 上的 transfer AUROC 为 0.62（显著高于随机但远低于 native）， 说明存在共享结构但不足以替代本地计算。 对论文而言：跨模型验证成功（框架有效），但方向不可直接迁移（需要本地校准数据）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"neutral_baseline_three_way\",\n    \"description\": \"引入 neutral condition 计算独立 d_gen，打破 d_gen = -d_syc 限制。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"d_syc_d_gen_cosine\": -0.72,\n      \"d_gen_independent_auroc\": 0.761,\n      \"d_syc_independent_auroc\": 0.838,\n      \"r2_with_independent_d_gen_nof\": 0.221,\n      \"r2_with_independent_d_gen_wrr\": 0.591,\n      \"r2_improvement_vs_rank_based_wrr_pp\": 0.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 18: Three-way Direction Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"cosine(d_syc\",\n            \"d_gen_independent)\",\n            -0.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cosine(d_syc\",\n            \"-d_syc)\",\n            -1.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"d_syc AUROC\",\n            0.838\n          ],\n          [\n            \"d_gen independent AUROC\",\n            0.761\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R2 w/ independent d_gen NoF\",\n            0.221\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R2 w/ independent d_gen WRR\",\n            0.591\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三方 baseline 确认 binary design 的局限性是温和的（cosine=-0.72 而非 -1.0）。 放在 appendix 作为 supplementary analysis。主论文中提及 rank-based R2 的设计选择 并引用此 appendix 作为 justification。\\n\\n\\nd_syc 和独立 d_gen 的 cosine 为 -0.72（而非理论退化值 -1.0）， 确认 binary design 中的 d_gen=-d_syc 假设虽然不精确但也不致命。 两个方向之间存在 ~44° 的夹角（arccos(-0.72)≈136°），说明 sycophantic 和 genuine 方向不是完全相反的——它们共享大部分对比信号但有 ~28% 的独立分量。 独立 d_gen 的 AUROC（0.761）低于 d_syc（0.838），因为 genuine revision 的表征信号 更弱且更分散——模型对\\\"被正确说服\\\"的内部表征不如\\\"迎合施压\\\"清晰。 用独立 d_gen 重新训练 R2 后，NoF 几乎不变（0.221 vs 0.218）但 WRR 微升（0.591 vs 0.584）， 改善仅 0.7pp——不值得增加方法复杂度。 结论：S1 rank-based R2 设计是合理的折衷，three-way design 可留作 future work。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"continuous_probe_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Continuous Probe Baseline：用 logistic regression 概率值作为 reward 信号， 隔离\\\"方向性 vs 连续性\\\"的贡献。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sycon_nof_mean\": 0.224,\n      \"sycon_nof_std\": 0.015,\n      \"sycon_tof_mean\": 0.726,\n      \"sycon_tof_std\": 0.018,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_mean\": 0.579,\n      \"warranted_revision_rate_std\": 0.023,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_mean\": 0.178,\n      \"unwarranted_capitulation_rate_std\": 0.017,\n      \"rc_auc_mean\": 0.731,\n      \"rc_auc_std\": 0.022,\n      \"mt_bench_score\": 7.44,\n      \"mt_bench_degradation\": 0.46,\n      \"mmlu_accuracy\": 0.627,\n      \"mmlu_degradation_pp\": 0.6,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_diff_pp\": -0.6,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_diff_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_nof_p_value\": 0.381,\n      \"dc_grpo_vs_continuous_probe_rcauc_p_value\": 0.318\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 19: Continuous Probe vs DC-GRPO Head-to-Head\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"continuous_probe\",\n          \"dc_grpo\",\n          \"diff_pp\",\n          \"p_value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NoF ↓\",\n            0.224,\n            0.218,\n            -0.6,\n            0.381\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WRR ↑\",\n            0.579,\n            0.584,\n            0.5,\n            0.412\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RC-AUC ↑\",\n            0.731,\n            0.738,\n            0.7,\n            0.318\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MT-Bench\",\n            7.44,\n            7.42,\n            -0.02,\n            0.891\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 20: Representation-level Methods Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"signal_type\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"rc_auc\",\n          \"vs_r3only_rcauc_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"R3-only\",\n            \"behavioral\",\n            0.291,\n            0.641,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary Probe\",\n            \"repr, discrete\",\n            0.239,\n            0.718,\n            7.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Continuous Probe\",\n            \"repr, continuous\",\n            0.224,\n            0.731,\n            9.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DC-GRPO\",\n            \"repr, directional\",\n            0.218,\n            0.738,\n            9.7\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Continuous Probe 是 median 档的 smoking gun：它证明 DC-GRPO 的优势主要来自 \\\"在训练 reward 中引入表征层连续信号\\\"这一设计选择，而非 d_syc 方向投影的特定几何。 论文叙事必须调整：Claim 2 从\\\"directional decomposition improves GRPO\\\"改为 \\\"representation-level continuous reward signals improve GRPO, and directional projection is one principled instantiation with interpretability advantages\\\"。 方向投影的独特卖点转向可解释性（方向有明确的几何含义）和分析工具价值（R1-R3 disagreement）， 而非训练效果的独占优势。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档最关键的实验结果。Continuous Probe 的 NoF（0.224）与 DC-GRPO（0.218） 差距仅 0.6pp（p=0.381），RC-AUC 差距仅 0.7pp（p=0.318）——完全不显著。 这意味着 DC-GRPO 相对 Binary Probe 的优势（~2pp NoF）几乎完全来自信号的连续性 （logistic regression 概率 vs binary 0/1），而非方向投影的几何特性。 logistic regression 在与 d_syc 相同的激活空间上训练，其决策超平面与 d_syc 高度相关 （cosine ≈ 0.89），但它通过 sigmoid 输出提供了平滑的概率 gradient， 与方向投影的连续值起到了几乎等价的作用。 这迫使论文叙事转向：不是\\\"方向投影是关键\\\"，而是\\\"表征层连续信号是关键， 方向投影是提取该信号的一种有效方法\\\"。 DC-GRPO 仍有微弱数值优势，可能来自方向投影对 outlier 的鲁棒性更好 （投影是线性的，不受 sigmoid 饱和影响），但这个差异不足以支撑显著性 claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reward_weight_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"测试 5 组 (w1, w2, w3) 配置的 NoF/WRR/RC-AUC 敏感度。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"config_default_w1_0.3_w2_0.2_w3_0.5\": {\n        \"nof\": 0.218,\n        \"wrr\": 0.584,\n        \"rc_auc\": 0.738\n      },\n      \"config_r1_dominant_w1_0.6_w2_0.1_w3_0.3\": {\n        \"nof\": 0.207,\n        \"wrr\": 0.521,\n        \"rc_auc\": 0.694\n      },\n      \"config_equal_w1_0.33_w2_0.33_w3_0.34\": {\n        \"nof\": 0.226,\n        \"wrr\": 0.573,\n        \"rc_auc\": 0.728\n      },\n      \"config_r3_dominant_w1_0.1_w2_0.1_w3_0.8\": {\n        \"nof\": 0.274,\n        \"wrr\": 0.562,\n        \"rc_auc\": 0.661\n      },\n      \"config_r2_enhanced_w1_0.2_w2_0.4_w3_0.4\": {\n        \"nof\": 0.231,\n        \"wrr\": 0.569,\n        \"rc_auc\": 0.722\n      },\n      \"nof_range_across_configs_pp\": 6.7,\n      \"wrr_range_across_configs_pp\": 6.3,\n      \"rc_auc_range_across_configs_pp\": 7.7,\n      \"best_rc_auc_config\": \"default\",\n      \"worst_rc_auc_config\": \"r3_dominant\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 21: Reward Weight Sensitivity Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"config\",\n          \"w1\",\n          \"w2\",\n          \"w3\",\n          \"nof\",\n          \"wrr\",\n          \"rc_auc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"R1-dominant\",\n            0.6,\n            0.1,\n            0.3,\n            0.207,\n            0.521,\n            0.694\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Default\",\n            0.3,\n            0.2,\n            0.5,\n            0.218,\n            0.584,\n            0.738\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Equal\",\n            0.33,\n            0.33,\n            0.34,\n            0.226,\n            0.573,\n            0.728\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R2-enhanced\",\n            0.2,\n            0.4,\n            0.4,\n            0.231,\n            0.569,\n            0.722\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R3-dominant\",\n            0.1,\n            0.1,\n            0.8,\n            0.274,\n            0.562,\n            0.661\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 22: Sensitivity Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"min\",\n          \"max\",\n          \"range_pp\",\n          \"best_config\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NoF\",\n            0.207,\n            0.274,\n            6.7,\n            \"R1-dominant\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WRR\",\n            0.521,\n            0.584,\n            6.3,\n            \"Default\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RC-AUC\",\n            0.661,\n            0.738,\n            7.7,\n            \"Default\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"权重敏感度在可接受范围内（RC-AUC 变化 7.7pp），default 配置接近最优。 论文中报告为\\\"中等鲁棒性\\\"：合理范围内结果稳定，但极端权重导致退化。 建议在 appendix 提供完整表格，主论文仅提及\\\"sensitivity analysis confirms robustness within w1 ∈ [0.2, 0.4], w3 ∈ [0.3, 0.5]\\\"。 如果 reviewer 追问 weight tuning，此实验是充分的防御。\\n\\nNoF 范围 6.7pp（0.207-0.274），在 4-8pp 预期区间内，表明中等敏感度。 R1-dominant 配置在 NoF 上最佳（0.207）但 WRR 崩溃（0.521），再次确认 R1 过度惩罚修正行为。 R3-dominant 配置最差（NoF 0.274），接近 R3-only baseline（0.291）， 说明当 R1 权重过低时表征信号的贡献被淹没。 Default 配置在 RC-AUC 上最佳（0.738），equal 配置接近（0.728）， 说明 default 权重选择虽无理论 justification 但经验上接近最优。 关键发现：(1) 只要 R1 权重 ≥ 0.2 且 R3 权重 ≥ 0.3，RC-AUC 都在 0.69+ 范围内—— 方法对权重选择中等鲁棒；(2) 极端配置（R1>0.5 或 R3>0.7）才导致显著退化。 这足以在论文中声称\\\"结果对合理权重范围内的选择鲁棒\\\"。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1354,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1354}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HKaBAz1nHDu7e4G8N7kzdQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the paper framing and experiment data. Let me write the full LaTeX paper. I need to:\n\n1. Create a complete LaTeX document covering all experiments\n2. Follow the narrative guidance: d_syc direction signal is useful but not deterministic; DC-GRPO advantages come from continuous representation signals rather than directional geometry specifically; soften claims accordingly\n3. Cover all 12 experiments with appropriate tables/sections\n4. Use the paper_framing.md for structure\n\nLet me organize the paper:\n\n- Abstract\n- Introduction (5-paragraph structure per writing norms)\n- Related Work\n- Method (d_syc direction extraction, DC-GRPO with R1/R2/R3, RC-AUC metric)\n\n\n- Experiments section covering setup, main results with full evaluation table, statistical significance testing, ablation studies examining individual reward components and sensitivity, turn depth and direction stability analyses, cross-model transfer performance, and R1-R3 disagreement patterns\n- Discussion and Analysis\n- Conclusion\n\nI need to be careful about avoiding em-dashes, en-dashes, -ing phrase endings, and AI-style language while writing the full LaTeX document.\n\nNow I'm reviewing the experimental data structure from the JSON file to understand what results I have available: calibration data expansion showing d_syc AUROC improvements across layers, the main DC-GRPO training results, several baselines including R3-only GRPO and ACT-style consistency approaches, complete evaluation metrics across all methods, direction stability monitoring during training, R1-R3 disagreement analysis, binary probe baseline, ablation studies for R1-only and R1+R2 without R3, and turn depth analysis. I'll use these specific numbers and results throughout the paper rather than making any assumptions.\n\nFor the paper structure, I'm organizing the experiments into a clear progression: the setup section will cover the calibration data from the first experiment, the main results section will present the full evaluation with the key performance tables, and then ablation studies broken down by component ablation comparing R1-only versus R1+R2 configurations, representation-level method comparisons between binary and continuous probe approaches, and sensitivity analysis for reward weighting.\n\nThe remaining analyses will cover turn depth effects, direction stability across different settings, cross-model transfer capabilities, and the disagreement patterns between R1 and R3, with the three-way direction analysis moved to the appendix for completeness.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2183,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21569,"cache_read_input_tokens":24393,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21569},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14d4612e-ac34-424e-8b81-3d8018208e76","uuid":"0ba8a66c-0dcb-4d44-a331-087694ec8bb2"}
